1
00:02:23,840 --> 00:02:26,119
I'm sorry for your loss, sister.

2
00:02:26,360 --> 00:02:28,359
May Allah bless you with patience.

3
00:02:30,240 --> 00:02:33,119
May our state live long, Bala Hatun.

4
00:02:33,120 --> 00:02:35,519
I had a son..

5
00:02:36,160 --> 00:02:38,479
...and he is now gone.

6
00:02:48,200 --> 00:02:49,919
Allah has blessed you with him...

7
00:02:50,800 --> 00:02:52,879
...and to Him he returned.

8
00:03:12,640 --> 00:03:14,319
My Halime.

9
00:03:16,120 --> 00:03:18,119
My beautiful girl.

10
00:03:49,080 --> 00:03:49,859
Give it to me.

11
00:03:49,859 --> 00:03:50,899
Bala Hatun, I can do this.

12
00:03:50,899 --> 00:03:52,039
Give it to me!

13
00:03:52,039 --> 00:03:53,759
Bala Hatun, don't.

14
00:03:54,080 --> 00:03:55,239
Ulgen.

15
00:03:55,480 --> 00:03:58,439
Now he returned to Allah. I won't be sad.

16
00:03:58,800 --> 00:04:00,719
At least let me do it.

17
00:04:00,720 --> 00:04:01,999
No, Kismet.

18
00:04:02,160 --> 00:04:04,039
I couldn't dig my daughter's grave.

19
00:04:04,040 --> 00:04:06,079
I will dig my son's grave.

20
00:04:13,760 --> 00:04:16,358
In the name of Allah, the
merciful, the compassionate.

21
00:04:28,760 --> 00:04:30,119
My child!

22
00:04:30,520 --> 00:04:33,639
My gold hearted little boy.

23
00:04:33,640 --> 00:04:35,639
My Alaeddin.

24
00:04:40,120 --> 00:04:43,639
Take care of your sister,
okay? She is so little.

25
00:04:43,800 --> 00:04:45,239
Take good care of her.

26
00:04:46,240 --> 00:04:47,839
My Halime.

27
00:04:54,560 --> 00:04:57,679
Allah blessed me with him,
and now he returned to Him.

28
00:04:58,920 --> 00:05:01,879
Just as I held him in my
arms when he was little...

29
00:05:02,280 --> 00:05:05,489
...I will dig his grave with
my hands as his mother!

30
00:05:05,800 --> 00:05:10,439
It's my right as his mother!

31
00:05:12,440 --> 00:05:15,439
Oh Allah, spare my Bey's life.

32
00:05:17,480 --> 00:05:20,839
Bring him back to his child.

33
00:05:22,040 --> 00:05:24,879
Sister, drink this.

34
00:05:25,400 --> 00:05:28,079
No, Fatma, thanks.

35
00:05:28,400 --> 00:05:29,719
Gonca Hatun.

36
00:05:30,680 --> 00:05:34,319
Gonca Hatun, Bala
Hatun is digging a grave.

37
00:05:48,480 --> 00:05:51,079
My Bey! Stop!

38
00:05:52,720 --> 00:05:54,919
My Bey, stop!

39
00:05:57,640 --> 00:05:59,639
Stop!

40
00:05:59,840 --> 00:06:00,919
Cerkutay?

41
00:06:00,920 --> 00:06:02,639
My Bey, stop!

42
00:06:05,680 --> 00:06:07,239
Cerkutay.

43
00:06:11,440 --> 00:06:14,599
My Bey, stop.

44
00:06:14,600 --> 00:06:15,359
My Bey.

45
00:06:15,360 --> 00:06:16,159
What happened.

46
00:06:16,160 --> 00:06:19,119
My Bey, Shahzade Alaeddin.

47
00:06:20,200 --> 00:06:24,399
He is in danger. They put him in a cage
and hanged the cage in front of the gates!

48
00:06:39,000 --> 00:06:43,039
Damn dastard! Damn Lord!

49
00:06:44,200 --> 00:06:46,759
He hides behind my son!

50
00:06:48,520 --> 00:06:53,119
My Bey, we can't strike
precisely from this distance.

51
00:06:54,840 --> 00:06:57,639
If Cerkutay Bey hadn't arrived...

52
00:06:57,880 --> 00:07:00,519
...we would have killed...

53
00:07:01,920 --> 00:07:03,919
Allah protected him, my Bey.

54
00:07:04,120 --> 00:07:05,719
Allah protected him.

55
00:07:05,720 --> 00:07:06,959
My Bey.

56
00:07:07,640 --> 00:07:12,719
This Lord is trying to hit
us where we are vulnerable!

57
00:07:21,800 --> 00:07:24,119
The catapults stopped.

58
00:07:24,920 --> 00:07:28,559
Osman faced the harsh truth.

59
00:07:31,360 --> 00:07:34,279
He will go back now.

60
00:07:34,600 --> 00:07:36,999
We can't use the catapults, my Bey.

61
00:07:37,080 --> 00:07:40,279
We can't besiege the
castle with just our swords.

62
00:07:40,680 --> 00:07:42,599
We would get destroyed.

63
00:07:42,600 --> 00:07:44,799
It's best to make an agreement, my Bey.

64
00:07:44,920 --> 00:07:48,119
We can't attack while
Alaeddin Bey is there.

65
00:07:48,280 --> 00:07:52,359
What's our Bey's decision?
What shall we do now Osman Bey?

66
00:07:53,240 --> 00:07:56,359
My Alps, my Beys.

67
00:07:58,040 --> 00:08:00,559
We can't stop because they have my son.

68
00:08:01,720 --> 00:08:02,759
But...

69
00:08:03,280 --> 00:08:05,519
...we can't give the Lord what he wants.

70
00:08:06,240 --> 00:08:09,679
We might not come
back from this. Tell me...

71
00:08:09,680 --> 00:08:11,279
Do you have my back?

72
00:08:11,280 --> 00:08:12,799
We are my Bey.

73
00:08:12,840 --> 00:08:13,679
Will you be there?

74
00:08:13,680 --> 00:08:14,839
We will my Bey.

75
00:08:14,840 --> 00:08:15,839
Are you with me?

76
00:08:15,840 --> 00:08:16,919
We are my Bey.

77
00:08:16,920 --> 00:08:18,439
We'll follow your path Osman Bey.

78
00:08:18,440 --> 00:08:20,439
We'll go wherever you wish.

79
00:08:20,680 --> 00:08:21,719
Boran.

80
00:08:21,800 --> 00:08:22,679
My Bey.

81
00:08:22,680 --> 00:08:24,399
Prepare 40 Alps.

82
00:08:24,840 --> 00:08:26,399
As you wish.

83
00:08:27,800 --> 00:08:28,719
Orhan.

84
00:08:28,880 --> 00:08:29,679
My Bey.

85
00:08:30,160 --> 00:08:31,639
You'll stay here.

86
00:08:32,440 --> 00:08:34,599
When you see the fire arrows...

87
00:08:34,600 --> 00:08:36,599
...you'll attack to save your brother.

88
00:08:36,880 --> 00:08:38,599
As you wish my Bey.

89
00:08:39,400 --> 00:08:40,599
It's time for Ghaza.

90
00:08:40,919 --> 00:08:42,599
It's time for blood.

91
00:08:42,919 --> 00:08:43,879
O Allah!

92
00:08:43,880 --> 00:08:49,319
Allah is the Greatest!

93
00:10:45,360 --> 00:10:46,279
Cerkutay.

94
00:10:46,279 --> 00:10:47,109
Yeah?

95
00:10:47,520 --> 00:10:49,319
Don't fall back brother.

96
00:10:49,480 --> 00:10:50,679
I'm coming.

97
00:10:51,160 --> 00:10:52,679
We're going up.

98
00:10:54,280 --> 00:10:56,159
Only we're crazy enough to do it.

99
00:10:59,880 --> 00:11:01,519
Lord will be shocked.

100
00:11:02,080 --> 00:11:05,839
I'll hit him where he least expects.

101
00:11:06,560 --> 00:11:09,119
Come on Alps. Go on!

102
00:11:09,120 --> 00:11:10,399
Come on Alps.

103
00:11:10,920 --> 00:11:13,239
Climb for Shehzade Alaeddin.

104
00:11:13,240 --> 00:11:15,239
Come on.

105
00:11:43,400 --> 00:11:44,439
Aunt.

106
00:11:45,280 --> 00:11:46,439
Aunt.

107
00:11:51,680 --> 00:11:52,839
Aunt.

108
00:11:58,240 --> 00:12:01,039
Alaeddin.

109
00:12:10,520 --> 00:12:11,679
Mother!

110
00:12:24,840 --> 00:12:27,679
Mother. Don't hide him from me mother.

111
00:12:29,280 --> 00:12:31,119
Mother is Alaeddin dead?

112
00:12:31,280 --> 00:12:32,759
Mother.
-Gonca.

113
00:12:33,320 --> 00:12:37,799
Is Alaeddin dead?

114
00:14:01,760 --> 00:14:05,559
-Gonca, look at me.
-Alaeddin...

115
00:14:05,640 --> 00:14:10,999
I don't know girl, I don't know about
tomorrow and the day after that anymore.

116
00:14:11,880 --> 00:14:18,159
Let not one but hundreds of Alaeddin
Alis be a sacrifice for this nation, girl.

117
00:14:18,160 --> 00:14:20,319
Let them be a sacrifice for it.

118
00:14:24,120 --> 00:14:25,959
-Mother.
-Gonca...

119
00:14:26,960 --> 00:14:29,319
Mother the baby...

120
00:14:31,040 --> 00:14:34,279
-Call the midwife.
-Run.

121
00:14:34,800 --> 00:14:36,839
Mother...

122
00:14:38,480 --> 00:14:41,079
The baby is coming.

123
00:14:48,480 --> 00:14:50,719
They fired the fire arrows.

124
00:14:50,840 --> 00:14:52,799
Thank Allah...

125
00:14:52,800 --> 00:14:54,359
They gave us the sign.

126
00:14:54,360 --> 00:14:56,279
Osman Bey did it.

127
00:14:56,280 --> 00:14:59,759
Our bey is inside the
walls of the infidels.

128
00:14:59,880 --> 00:15:02,959
Now our destination is Karadin Castle.

129
00:15:02,960 --> 00:15:06,199
Allah is the Greatest!

130
00:15:19,960 --> 00:15:22,279
Raid!

131
00:15:34,440 --> 00:15:36,559
How could this be?

132
00:16:29,480 --> 00:16:31,599
Oh Allah.

133
00:16:31,720 --> 00:16:34,759
Soldiers, to the yard.

134
00:16:34,760 --> 00:16:36,919
Get in the attack position!

135
00:16:45,520 --> 00:16:47,199
Attack.

136
00:16:47,480 --> 00:16:49,079
Allah is Everlasting.

137
00:16:49,080 --> 00:16:51,519
Allah is Truthful.

138
00:16:54,000 --> 00:16:56,399
Alaeddin, we made it brother hold on.

139
00:16:56,400 --> 00:16:57,959
Brother.

140
00:16:58,200 --> 00:16:59,839
Brother...

141
00:17:03,920 --> 00:17:06,519
Allah is the Greatest!

142
00:17:07,880 --> 00:17:09,799
Put up the ladder.

143
00:17:09,800 --> 00:17:11,759
Thank Allah.

144
00:17:13,358 --> 00:17:15,439
Thank Allah...

145
00:17:16,400 --> 00:17:21,877
Allah is the Greatest!

146
00:17:55,120 --> 00:17:58,199
Allah is the Greatest!

147
00:18:22,600 --> 00:18:25,479
You will pay dearly for this, Osman!

148
00:18:25,480 --> 00:18:28,119
Your son Alaeddin will die!

149
00:18:28,120 --> 00:18:30,279
I did not come here to pay...

150
00:18:30,440 --> 00:18:32,599
...I came to make you pay!

151
00:18:32,600 --> 00:18:35,239
Kill Alaeddin!

152
00:18:40,160 --> 00:18:43,519
Hold on brother!

153
00:18:44,800 --> 00:18:47,039
Hold on Alaeddin!

154
00:19:07,800 --> 00:19:09,879
Hold on Alaeddin!

155
00:19:11,000 --> 00:19:13,719
Hold on tight!

156
00:19:32,560 --> 00:19:35,519
I will finish this myself!

157
00:19:35,880 --> 00:19:40,159
Lord!

158
00:19:54,200 --> 00:19:55,959
Lord!

159
00:20:11,440 --> 00:20:13,199
Karesi Bey.

160
00:20:17,120 --> 00:20:18,319
So...

161
00:20:20,080 --> 00:20:25,079
...you are the famous
commander that is favored by...

162
00:20:25,320 --> 00:20:26,799
...the emperor.

163
00:20:28,960 --> 00:20:33,799
Did you come to Bursa
with 20 warships to show off?

164
00:20:34,680 --> 00:20:38,239
Not to show off, but to make a statement.

165
00:20:40,160 --> 00:20:44,319
You should know that if
I don't get what I want...

166
00:20:45,880 --> 00:20:48,319
...I will not leave any
building standing...

167
00:20:48,720 --> 00:20:52,399
..and any heads over shoulders!

168
00:20:58,000 --> 00:21:00,959
Don't confuse me with ordinary Lords.

169
00:21:00,960 --> 00:21:03,599
I wouldn't run from a fight.

170
00:21:05,160 --> 00:21:08,879
Why did you come here, tell me that.

171
00:21:19,640 --> 00:21:22,719
Allah is the Greatest!

172
00:21:23,680 --> 00:21:28,719
Allah is the Greatest!

173
00:21:34,240 --> 00:21:37,479
You will die!

174
00:21:42,800 --> 00:21:44,159
Lord!

175
00:21:49,320 --> 00:21:51,479
Alaeddin!

176
00:22:15,480 --> 00:22:18,919
I won't let go!

177
00:22:22,600 --> 00:22:24,519
Alaeddin!

178
00:22:26,880 --> 00:22:28,079
Father...

179
00:22:28,080 --> 00:22:30,799
Don't worry. I will never let go!

180
00:22:30,800 --> 00:22:34,919
I won't!

181
00:22:43,400 --> 00:22:44,679
My Bey!

182
00:22:46,960 --> 00:22:48,919
Alaeddin, hold on!

183
00:22:52,520 --> 00:22:55,439
Hold on, son!

184
00:23:06,320 --> 00:23:07,879
My Bey.
-I'm coming Osman Bey.

185
00:23:08,920 --> 00:23:10,119
Hang on brother.

186
00:23:10,280 --> 00:23:11,359
Hang on.

187
00:23:18,440 --> 00:23:19,399
Pull!

188
00:23:20,760 --> 00:23:21,959
Hang on Alaeddin!

189
00:23:23,680 --> 00:23:24,719
Pull.

190
00:23:35,240 --> 00:23:36,679
Cerkutay! The gate!

191
00:23:46,080 --> 00:23:47,239
Come on!

192
00:23:59,800 --> 00:24:01,319
Behind us!

193
00:24:04,880 --> 00:24:05,919
Come on!

194
00:24:13,880 --> 00:24:15,319
Alaeddin.

195
00:24:22,640 --> 00:24:24,679
Come on.

196
00:24:27,640 --> 00:24:29,319
Alaeddin.
-My Bey.

197
00:24:29,760 --> 00:24:31,519
Son.
-Father.

198
00:24:34,400 --> 00:24:37,239
Thank Allah.

199
00:24:37,560 --> 00:24:39,279
I knew it.

200
00:24:42,320 --> 00:24:44,079
Brother.

201
00:24:44,400 --> 00:24:45,559
My brother.

202
00:24:47,200 --> 00:24:48,759
You're okay. You're okay.

203
00:24:49,160 --> 00:24:49,879
You're okay.

204
00:24:50,440 --> 00:24:51,679
You're okay.

205
00:24:55,920 --> 00:24:57,559
Thank Allah.

206
00:25:02,240 --> 00:25:04,479
It's my fault...

207
00:25:05,400 --> 00:25:07,559
I put you in a tough spot.

208
00:25:08,080 --> 00:25:09,879
Forgive me.

209
00:25:10,400 --> 00:25:13,399
Don't say that. Don't.

210
00:25:13,760 --> 00:25:15,399
There's good in everything son.

211
00:25:16,040 --> 00:25:17,399
There's good in everything.

212
00:25:19,760 --> 00:25:20,799
There is.

213
00:25:31,000 --> 00:25:33,439
Karadin castle...

214
00:25:35,000 --> 00:25:36,759
...is Kayi property now.

215
00:25:36,760 --> 00:25:42,399
Allah is the Greatest!

216
00:25:43,120 --> 00:25:45,519
Your conquest shall be blessed, Osman Bey.

217
00:25:45,800 --> 00:25:47,319
Thank you.

218
00:25:47,480 --> 00:25:48,479
Thank you.

219
00:25:49,000 --> 00:25:49,959
Thank you.

220
00:25:52,160 --> 00:25:53,159
Son.

221
00:25:53,400 --> 00:25:57,159
Your mother and Hatun
are worried about you.

222
00:25:57,160 --> 00:25:59,159
Go to the tribe now.

223
00:26:00,160 --> 00:26:01,199
As you wish my Bey.

224
00:26:01,200 --> 00:26:02,359
Don't make them wait.

225
00:26:05,000 --> 00:26:05,879
Come on.

226
00:26:17,360 --> 00:26:19,079
I came all this way.

227
00:26:19,360 --> 00:26:20,559
Because...

228
00:26:21,160 --> 00:26:23,959
...our holy relics are stolen.

229
00:26:25,120 --> 00:26:27,439
And you suspect me?

230
00:26:27,640 --> 00:26:30,279
If I did, I'd be here...

231
00:26:31,320 --> 00:26:32,919
...with an army.

232
00:26:35,320 --> 00:26:38,999
But my men lost the thief's track...

233
00:26:39,560 --> 00:26:41,359
..in your land...

234
00:26:42,600 --> 00:26:45,319
..in Bursa. And here I am.

235
00:26:46,760 --> 00:26:47,559
So...

236
00:26:49,600 --> 00:26:50,959
...let's say..

237
00:26:51,600 --> 00:26:53,639
...I found the relics for you.

238
00:26:55,600 --> 00:26:58,079
What's in it for me?

239
00:26:59,640 --> 00:27:01,719
A long life span.

240
00:27:02,680 --> 00:27:06,319
And I'll keep my ships in Bursa.

241
00:27:07,920 --> 00:27:08,959
What else?

242
00:27:11,840 --> 00:27:13,839
Your ships...

243
00:27:14,200 --> 00:27:17,599
..and your men won't scare me Karesi Bey.

244
00:27:18,280 --> 00:27:22,519
I'll do as you wish under one condition.

245
00:27:29,520 --> 00:27:31,719
Osman. Osman.

246
00:27:32,440 --> 00:27:34,599
Osman wants my tribes in the border.

247
00:27:35,040 --> 00:27:37,199
We both know what he wants.

248
00:27:38,360 --> 00:27:40,479
I ask you Karesi Bey.

249
00:27:40,720 --> 00:27:42,959
Can you stop Osman?

250
00:27:43,840 --> 00:27:46,519
My greatness is capable of everything.

251
00:27:46,520 --> 00:27:48,519
Of course Osman will obey me.

252
00:27:55,600 --> 00:27:57,599
Then we have an agreement.

253
00:27:57,880 --> 00:28:01,359
If it's as you say and
the relics are in Bursa...

254
00:28:01,360 --> 00:28:04,119
...then I'll find them for you.

255
00:28:21,440 --> 00:28:25,599
Commander Lucas, Osman
Bey has taken the Karadin Castle.

256
00:28:32,880 --> 00:28:36,039
Get out.

257
00:28:36,040 --> 00:28:37,479
All of you, out.

258
00:28:37,480 --> 00:28:40,439
Out.

259
00:28:57,920 --> 00:28:59,199
Tell me if they're okay.

260
00:28:59,200 --> 00:29:02,119
There's still time, Bala Hatun.

261
00:29:12,080 --> 00:29:13,279
Gonca.

262
00:29:14,880 --> 00:29:16,519
Is the baby coming? What's happening?

263
00:29:16,520 --> 00:29:19,039
Alaeddin...

264
00:29:19,040 --> 00:29:20,359
You came, Alaeddin.

265
00:29:20,360 --> 00:29:23,599
-You came.
-I'm here now dear, I'm here Gonca.

266
00:29:24,480 --> 00:29:27,759
Thank Allah.

267
00:29:27,760 --> 00:29:30,399
Alaeddin.

268
00:29:33,000 --> 00:29:35,519
Thank Allah.

269
00:29:35,520 --> 00:29:39,599
I'm here.

270
00:29:39,880 --> 00:29:40,959
Mother.

271
00:29:40,960 --> 00:29:42,839
-Brother.
-Son.

272
00:29:42,840 --> 00:29:46,119
-Welcome.
-Thank you mother.

273
00:29:48,040 --> 00:29:49,399
Sister.

274
00:29:51,120 --> 00:29:52,999
My dear.

275
00:29:53,000 --> 00:29:56,359
Thank Allah..

276
00:29:59,360 --> 00:30:01,399
Mother? What happened to you?

277
00:30:01,400 --> 00:30:02,919
It's nothing.

278
00:30:02,920 --> 00:30:05,639
Since the birth is near my
grandkid is not staying still.

279
00:30:05,640 --> 00:30:06,799
You say so...

280
00:30:06,800 --> 00:30:08,839
Go ahead. Go.

281
00:30:08,840 --> 00:30:10,599
Gonca.

282
00:30:10,600 --> 00:30:12,159
My dear...

283
00:30:12,160 --> 00:30:13,959
You came.

284
00:30:17,320 --> 00:30:18,759
Mother.

285
00:30:18,760 --> 00:30:20,959
Osman Bey has conquered Karadin.

286
00:30:20,960 --> 00:30:24,359
He told me to tell you that
there will be a feast tonight.

287
00:30:24,720 --> 00:30:26,799
Praise be..

288
00:30:26,920 --> 00:30:28,359
Ulgen.

289
00:30:28,360 --> 00:30:32,719
Get whatever we need, let's
celebrate well for our success.

290
00:30:32,720 --> 00:30:34,519
Don't worry at all Bala Hatun.

291
00:30:34,620 --> 00:30:35,519
Come on.

292
00:30:35,520 --> 00:30:36,759
You're okay, right dear?

293
00:30:36,760 --> 00:30:37,679
We're okay.

294
00:30:37,680 --> 00:30:39,239
Praise be.

295
00:30:54,200 --> 00:30:56,519
What is the situation of the gates?

296
00:30:56,520 --> 00:31:00,079
The north and the west gates
are very worn down, my bey.

297
00:31:00,400 --> 00:31:02,119
Fix them as soon as possible.

298
00:31:02,120 --> 00:31:03,569
Sure, my bey.

299
00:31:03,760 --> 00:31:06,039
How about the walls?

300
00:31:06,120 --> 00:31:08,919
There are some weak
spots at south, my bey.

301
00:31:08,920 --> 00:31:11,039
Then put all the alps there.

302
00:31:11,040 --> 00:31:14,439
They're going to work on it
until it's as strong as possible.

303
00:31:15,440 --> 00:31:17,039
How about the wells?

304
00:31:17,040 --> 00:31:20,639
When they realized the castle was going
to fall, the infidels poisoned them all.

305
00:31:20,640 --> 00:31:24,559
Then we're going to dig up new ones.

306
00:31:29,400 --> 00:31:32,719
Alps, hold on.

307
00:31:34,680 --> 00:31:35,959
Osman Bey.

308
00:31:35,960 --> 00:31:38,799
God bless you,
you showed us Christians mercy...

309
00:31:38,800 --> 00:31:43,279
...by not
ripping us apart from our land.

310
00:31:44,240 --> 00:31:46,919
Thank you, may Allah bless you.

311
00:31:47,960 --> 00:31:49,319
Don't worry.

312
00:31:49,320 --> 00:31:52,319
With this conquest not only
will mercy come your way...

313
00:31:52,320 --> 00:31:55,119
...but also a just will.

314
00:31:56,720 --> 00:31:57,799
My bey.

315
00:31:57,800 --> 00:32:00,119
The door to the treasury has been opened.

316
00:32:00,120 --> 00:32:01,519
Alright, Turan.

317
00:32:01,520 --> 00:32:06,479
Then let the alps and the
beys take their share from it.

318
00:32:07,720 --> 00:32:10,079
Turan, we're going to the tribe.

319
00:32:10,320 --> 00:32:12,799
You will watch over this place.

320
00:32:12,800 --> 00:32:14,879
As you wish my bey.

321
00:32:15,320 --> 00:32:17,039
Come on then.

322
00:32:19,720 --> 00:32:21,159
Sister.

323
00:32:22,400 --> 00:32:25,759
Who do you think Osman Bey
will give the Karadin Castle to?

324
00:32:26,680 --> 00:32:30,639
Gencer, that ill looking Bayhan...

325
00:32:30,720 --> 00:32:34,839
Even though they don't say it, all
the beys in the divan want the castle.

326
00:32:35,240 --> 00:32:39,479
Even though lot of people are after
it, the rule over the Karadin Castle...

327
00:32:39,480 --> 00:32:41,879
...is suitable for us, the Kecelisahs.

328
00:32:41,880 --> 00:32:44,559
Osman Bey doesn't do wrong.

329
00:32:44,840 --> 00:32:46,759
He will give us the rule...

330
00:32:46,760 --> 00:32:48,759
...and give us more glory, if Allah permits.

331
00:32:48,760 --> 00:32:51,039
If Allah permits.

332
00:32:53,280 --> 00:32:57,239
Choose a gift for Fatma
Hatun from the treasure.

333
00:32:58,240 --> 00:33:00,839
Once we go back to the
tribe you can give it to her.

334
00:33:00,840 --> 00:33:02,839
Okay my bey.

335
00:33:03,160 --> 00:33:04,559
When will we move?

336
00:33:04,560 --> 00:33:07,359
Whenever commander Lucas gives order

337
00:33:36,200 --> 00:33:39,839
Just like God, I don't like...

338
00:33:40,160 --> 00:33:42,639
...cowards and impotent men.

339
00:33:42,760 --> 00:33:45,639
Life doesn't..

340
00:33:45,680 --> 00:33:49,559
...give second chances to weak people.

341
00:34:08,000 --> 00:34:09,679
Look at my face.

342
00:34:14,600 --> 00:34:16,399
What did he do?

343
00:34:17,840 --> 00:34:21,599
He committed the greatest sin! Weakness!

344
00:34:23,120 --> 00:34:25,559
He showed weakness!

345
00:34:27,800 --> 00:34:32,638
It's a pit where creatures called
humans constantly fall in!

346
00:34:32,719 --> 00:34:37,119
While fighting for Holy Rome,
there is no place for cowardice!

347
00:34:39,159 --> 00:34:41,839
No place for inattention!

348
00:34:44,080 --> 00:34:46,989
If necessary, your heads...

349
00:34:47,719 --> 00:34:50,799
...will be removed from your bodies!

350
00:34:50,800 --> 00:34:54,359
No matter who the enemy is...

351
00:34:55,080 --> 00:34:58,879
...they will be under my feet!

352
00:35:00,320 --> 00:35:03,839
Turks have taken another castle!

353
00:35:05,200 --> 00:35:07,679
That much weakness is enough.

354
00:35:10,120 --> 00:35:12,479
Now it's my turn to make a move.

355
00:35:13,000 --> 00:35:14,839
Wait for my orders!

356
00:35:25,520 --> 00:35:26,839
Peace be with you my Bey.

357
00:35:26,840 --> 00:35:28,119
Peace be upon you.

358
00:35:28,440 --> 00:35:32,439
What's the situation. Is there
anyone that heard about the relics?

359
00:35:32,440 --> 00:35:36,479
I asked around my Bey, but no one knows.

360
00:35:39,680 --> 00:35:44,639
The sacred relics of the Islam
world are stolen, but no one knows?

361
00:35:47,320 --> 00:35:48,719
Someone's there!

362
00:35:49,040 --> 00:35:51,679
Alps! Look around

363
00:35:52,760 --> 00:35:54,679
Baysungur!

364
00:36:17,200 --> 00:36:19,799
Spread out! Search everywhere.

365
00:36:26,720 --> 00:36:29,239
There he is! Capture him!

366
00:36:33,280 --> 00:36:36,959
I learned it, my Bey.

367
00:36:37,120 --> 00:36:38,719
I learned it.

368
00:36:44,920 --> 00:36:49,159
Beys are coming! Osman Bey is coming!

369
00:36:49,720 --> 00:36:53,879
Beys are coming! Osman Bey is coming!

370
00:36:53,880 --> 00:36:59,799
Osman Bey is coming!

371
00:37:28,760 --> 00:37:29,839
My daughter.

372
00:37:29,840 --> 00:37:31,279
Father.

373
00:37:31,720 --> 00:37:33,119
Fatma.

374
00:37:33,120 --> 00:37:34,959
Brother.

375
00:37:46,840 --> 00:37:48,279
Bala.

376
00:37:48,280 --> 00:37:49,579
Brother.

377
00:37:49,600 --> 00:37:50,839
Sister.

378
00:37:51,120 --> 00:37:52,599
My Osman.

379
00:37:57,360 --> 00:37:58,799
Congratulations on your victory, my Bey.

380
00:37:58,800 --> 00:38:01,399
Thank you.

381
00:38:01,840 --> 00:38:04,719
We will glorify our victory at the feast.

382
00:38:05,600 --> 00:38:08,919
I will declare at the feast
whom to give the castle.

383
00:38:08,920 --> 00:38:10,519
If Allah permits.

384
00:38:13,880 --> 00:38:14,759
Boran.

385
00:38:14,760 --> 00:38:15,389
My Bey.

386
00:38:15,389 --> 00:38:16,759
Start the preparations for the feast.

387
00:38:16,760 --> 00:38:18,759
As you command my Bey.

388
00:38:19,000 --> 00:38:19,879
Aykurt.

389
00:38:20,000 --> 00:38:20,919
Come on.

390
00:38:20,920 --> 00:38:22,039
Yes Boran Bey.

391
00:38:22,840 --> 00:38:25,279
Brother. Feast is tonight.

392
00:38:25,280 --> 00:38:27,279
Bey will announce the castle's owner.

393
00:38:27,640 --> 00:38:29,279
Make sure everything's set.

394
00:38:29,760 --> 00:38:31,279
Don't worry Boran Bey.

395
00:38:31,560 --> 00:38:33,079
We'll do it now for sure.

396
00:38:33,120 --> 00:38:34,239
Thank you, brother.

397
00:38:41,200 --> 00:38:41,959
Begum Hatun.

398
00:38:42,960 --> 00:38:43,679
Come.

399
00:38:48,160 --> 00:38:51,039
Mother cooked amazing food, father.

400
00:38:52,760 --> 00:38:54,239
Come on.

401
00:38:54,240 --> 00:38:55,079
Let's go.

402
00:38:59,280 --> 00:39:00,359
Begum Hatun.

403
00:39:00,560 --> 00:39:03,199
Sisters will show you your tent.

404
00:39:03,200 --> 00:39:05,199
If you need anything tell us.

405
00:39:05,960 --> 00:39:07,679
Thank you Fatma Hatun.

406
00:39:07,960 --> 00:39:09,679
Thanks for your trouble.

407
00:39:15,240 --> 00:39:16,479
Not at all.

408
00:39:16,840 --> 00:39:17,799
Excuse me.

409
00:39:23,400 --> 00:39:25,639
I told you to make good with her.

410
00:39:25,720 --> 00:39:27,639
But she's running from you instead.

411
00:39:30,480 --> 00:39:32,599
Sister, there was chaos.

412
00:39:32,600 --> 00:39:34,599
I didn't have the time.

413
00:39:34,640 --> 00:39:36,839
Hurry up Yusuf.

414
00:39:37,120 --> 00:39:39,239
Future of our tribe is in your hands.

415
00:39:42,400 --> 00:39:46,199
Your father saved Shehzade
Alaeddin and Osman Bey.

416
00:39:46,600 --> 00:39:48,599
Praise be!

417
00:39:49,680 --> 00:39:51,239
My husband.

418
00:39:54,200 --> 00:39:57,359
Osman Bey will give you the castle then.

419
00:39:58,160 --> 00:39:59,119
I hope so.

420
00:40:00,640 --> 00:40:02,839
If Karadin is ours...

421
00:40:04,200 --> 00:40:07,959
...I'll be of higher status among Beys.

422
00:40:09,200 --> 00:40:11,119
They'll obey me.

423
00:40:15,840 --> 00:40:19,639
Now that I've earned the castle...

424
00:40:20,480 --> 00:40:23,879
...Osman Bey will give it to me.

425
00:40:24,280 --> 00:40:25,359
I hope so.

426
00:40:27,880 --> 00:40:29,439
He'll do it my Bey.

427
00:40:31,000 --> 00:40:35,039
He's not going to give it to
someone else when there's you.

428
00:40:38,160 --> 00:40:41,039
Osman Bey will give
me it. But... Saruca...

429
00:40:41,720 --> 00:40:43,679
...give Fatma Hatun your present.

430
00:40:44,240 --> 00:40:45,439
My Bey.

431
00:40:47,480 --> 00:40:48,839
I'll do it.

432
00:40:49,240 --> 00:40:50,599
I'll do it but...

433
00:40:52,040 --> 00:40:53,159
...what if she doesn't accept?

434
00:40:55,840 --> 00:40:58,399
Bey. Listen to him.

435
00:40:58,880 --> 00:41:00,799
Son. Saruca.

436
00:41:01,240 --> 00:41:06,599
You're a handsome and brave
man. Of course she'll accept.

437
00:41:11,240 --> 00:41:12,479
Right my Bey?

438
00:41:14,560 --> 00:41:15,399
Yes. Right.

439
00:41:16,240 --> 00:41:16,999
Right.

440
00:41:24,160 --> 00:41:26,879
Give Fatma Hatun your gift.

441
00:41:28,240 --> 00:41:30,159
Make good with her.

442
00:41:36,320 --> 00:41:37,279
Father.

443
00:41:38,760 --> 00:41:42,319
Maybe we'll get the
castle and Fatma Hatun.

444
00:41:43,840 --> 00:41:46,599
I hope so, my son.

445
00:41:47,320 --> 00:41:48,439
Father.

446
00:41:48,680 --> 00:41:49,399
I'll go...

447
00:41:50,440 --> 00:41:52,959
...and give Fatma Hatun her gift.

448
00:41:53,000 --> 00:41:53,719
Yes.

449
00:41:53,840 --> 00:41:54,759
I'll do it father.

450
00:41:54,800 --> 00:41:55,639
Go on.

451
00:41:55,800 --> 00:41:56,799
Good.

452
00:41:58,120 --> 00:41:59,279
Good.

453
00:42:05,920 --> 00:42:06,999
Father.

454
00:42:07,440 --> 00:42:09,799
I was afraid you'd be hurt.

455
00:42:10,720 --> 00:42:13,159
What if you die like mother?

456
00:42:13,320 --> 00:42:14,079
My girl.

457
00:42:15,600 --> 00:42:17,039
My sweet girl.

458
00:42:18,280 --> 00:42:19,159
Don't be afraid.

459
00:42:19,840 --> 00:42:21,519
I'll be here always.

460
00:42:22,480 --> 00:42:23,839
Look at me.

461
00:42:24,880 --> 00:42:26,919
Do you pray for me?

462
00:42:27,000 --> 00:42:28,159
I do of course.

463
00:42:29,080 --> 00:42:31,959
Father. When will we talk to Osman Bey?

464
00:42:33,680 --> 00:42:34,959
It's a secret Ayse.

465
00:42:35,360 --> 00:42:36,799
Did you forget?

466
00:42:37,640 --> 00:42:38,959
I didn't.

467
00:42:38,960 --> 00:42:41,999
But I don't know why it's a secret.

468
00:42:45,120 --> 00:42:46,879
You promised your father.

469
00:42:48,200 --> 00:42:50,079
You won't say a word.

470
00:42:51,720 --> 00:42:53,719
This is between us.

471
00:42:54,480 --> 00:42:55,239
Promise?

472
00:42:58,720 --> 00:42:59,719
Promise.

473
00:43:11,320 --> 00:43:13,159
-Good work sisters.
-Thank you.

474
00:43:13,160 --> 00:43:15,319
Hatun.
-Thanks Fatma Hatun.

475
00:43:18,080 --> 00:43:19,999
Fatma Hatun.

476
00:43:21,520 --> 00:43:22,799
Saruca Bey...

477
00:43:22,800 --> 00:43:24,719
Are you busy Fatma Hatun?

478
00:43:24,720 --> 00:43:26,519
Not at the moment.

479
00:43:26,840 --> 00:43:28,319
Erm...

480
00:43:28,800 --> 00:43:31,679
It's not worthy of you but...

481
00:43:38,720 --> 00:43:40,879
..it's my share from...

482
00:43:41,120 --> 00:43:42,919
...the castle treasure.

483
00:43:46,480 --> 00:43:50,559
I'm sorry Fatma Hatun,
giving this to you...

484
00:43:52,240 --> 00:43:54,119
Thank you...

485
00:43:54,120 --> 00:43:57,279
...but I don't understand
the reasoning behind this gift.

486
00:43:57,280 --> 00:43:59,559
Out of politeness.

487
00:44:00,640 --> 00:44:03,839
You've been a good host to us twice now.

488
00:44:03,840 --> 00:44:07,319
He is showing his appreciation
through this kind act.

489
00:44:07,320 --> 00:44:08,839
I believe...

490
00:44:08,840 --> 00:44:11,959
...that's why you're here too...

491
00:44:12,080 --> 00:44:13,359
...Yusuf Bey.

492
00:44:13,640 --> 00:44:15,799
Yes, Saruca Bey.

493
00:44:16,800 --> 00:44:18,759
Fatma Hatun.

494
00:44:20,440 --> 00:44:23,799
I've heard your talent with the bow.

495
00:44:24,160 --> 00:44:26,599
It might not be my place but...

496
00:44:26,600 --> 00:44:29,175
...when I saw this bow
in the treasury I thought

497
00:44:29,187 --> 00:44:31,879
it would be a waste if
someone else had it but you.

498
00:44:32,840 --> 00:44:36,599
If you accept it, you'd
make me really happy.

499
00:44:52,840 --> 00:44:56,719
You've heard my talent with the bow but...

500
00:44:56,720 --> 00:45:02,159
...Osman Bey's daughter
doesn't take gifts from everyone.

501
00:45:02,880 --> 00:45:05,919
Now you know that too.

502
00:45:21,280 --> 00:45:24,359
The sacred relics of the Muslims.

503
00:45:24,760 --> 00:45:27,359
This give us immense power.

504
00:45:27,400 --> 00:45:29,439
We have to use it well.

505
00:45:29,440 --> 00:45:30,799
Power...

506
00:45:31,080 --> 00:45:33,679
It's a great gift, commander.

507
00:45:34,120 --> 00:45:36,919
Who will you give this to?

508
00:45:36,920 --> 00:45:40,199
Once Osman and Karesi
get on each other's bad side...

509
00:45:40,320 --> 00:45:43,439
...they'll be wiped clean from my path.

510
00:45:43,520 --> 00:45:48,839
Since Karesi Bey has the reign over
the seas he's stronger, commander.

511
00:45:49,360 --> 00:45:52,402
On the other hand, with his
nation growing bigger day by day

512
00:45:52,414 --> 00:45:55,519
everyone knows how talented
Osman Bey is when it comes to war.

513
00:45:59,600 --> 00:46:01,799
The servers of the great Rome.

514
00:46:01,800 --> 00:46:04,039
You may leave.

515
00:46:09,440 --> 00:46:11,439
Sweet Holofira.

516
00:46:11,440 --> 00:46:15,079
You see how much I try for peace, right?

517
00:46:16,640 --> 00:46:21,639
Osman Bey is holding a feast to
celebrate taking Karadin Castle.

518
00:46:21,640 --> 00:46:25,039
I want you to attend that feast.

519
00:46:26,000 --> 00:46:27,359
I'm sorry.

520
00:46:27,960 --> 00:46:31,959
Unfortunately I won't be
able to fulfill your request.

521
00:46:37,840 --> 00:46:40,839
Holofira..

522
00:46:41,000 --> 00:46:44,879
Don't forget why I went all
that way to find you, okay?

523
00:46:44,960 --> 00:46:48,679
You have the power to make
Osman Bey believe in my good will.

524
00:46:48,680 --> 00:46:53,239
I want you to tell him that I'm
inviting him to the arena at this feast.

525
00:47:06,960 --> 00:47:08,799
Cecilia...

526
00:47:09,600 --> 00:47:11,639
Do you know when the feast of Turks...

527
00:47:11,640 --> 00:47:15,079
...turn into a real feast?

528
00:47:16,000 --> 00:47:19,439
When their joy is tainted by death.

529
00:47:19,520 --> 00:47:22,279
How will that be sir?

530
00:47:40,840 --> 00:47:43,839
A sparkle that will be
placed by your hands...

531
00:47:43,840 --> 00:47:46,799
...will turn into a wildfire.

532
00:47:46,800 --> 00:47:50,199
That's when Osman's
feast will take a turn.

533
00:47:50,480 --> 00:47:52,399
You're going to drown
his happiest moment...

534
00:47:52,520 --> 00:47:55,439
...in grief.

535
00:48:19,560 --> 00:48:21,199
My Osman.

536
00:48:23,160 --> 00:48:25,599
Bayhan Bey, Begum Hatun...

537
00:48:25,600 --> 00:48:28,879
All of your beys want the castle.

538
00:48:29,200 --> 00:48:31,879
Who are you thinking of?

539
00:48:32,400 --> 00:48:34,679
You tell me Bala.

540
00:48:35,720 --> 00:48:37,079
Who do you think...

541
00:48:37,520 --> 00:48:39,119
...deserves it the most?

542
00:48:40,480 --> 00:48:45,199
From what I heard, Bayhan Bey is greedy.

543
00:48:46,000 --> 00:48:50,439
Begum Hatun is ambitious,
she aims for higher places.

544
00:48:52,080 --> 00:48:55,079
So they will stay with us as
long as it's in their interests.

545
00:48:56,680 --> 00:49:00,599
Then we will give the castle
to the one with weakest loyalty.

546
00:49:04,160 --> 00:49:05,999
Begum Hatun?

547
00:49:06,840 --> 00:49:09,359
No, not her.

548
00:49:17,120 --> 00:49:18,999
Why is that?

549
00:49:20,120 --> 00:49:22,719
I don't trust that Hatun.

550
00:49:23,200 --> 00:49:25,679
You shouldn't entrust the castle to him.

551
00:49:34,680 --> 00:49:37,359
Look at me.

552
00:49:37,840 --> 00:49:43,119
Come on. So you are saying telling me
that you know the answer to that question?

553
00:49:49,960 --> 00:49:53,359
My dear, why are you angry?

554
00:49:53,360 --> 00:49:55,599
I am not angry.

555
00:49:56,000 --> 00:49:59,679
I am just saying that
we should be cautious, my Bey.

556
00:50:04,160 --> 00:50:05,999
Don't laugh.

557
00:50:10,160 --> 00:50:11,679
I am serious.

558
00:50:15,960 --> 00:50:17,079
Understood.

559
00:50:17,080 --> 00:50:19,679
But if you want to give it to her...

560
00:50:20,040 --> 00:50:22,479
...then you will suffer
by my hand, Osman Bey.

561
00:50:25,640 --> 00:50:28,519
Well, there is nothing to do.

562
00:50:29,440 --> 00:50:33,039
If it's you, I am ready to suffer.

563
00:50:46,440 --> 00:50:48,399
Alps!

564
00:50:49,200 --> 00:50:53,479
Two brave alps, both
strong and courageous.

565
00:50:54,600 --> 00:50:57,319
They are here.

566
00:50:58,240 --> 00:51:00,719
Now, they will fire arrows...

567
00:51:00,960 --> 00:51:04,199
...and we will see who is the...

568
00:51:04,960 --> 00:51:07,999
..most skilled archer.

569
00:51:11,920 --> 00:51:13,959
You are the prey.

570
00:51:16,080 --> 00:51:18,959
And you are the hunter.

571
00:51:22,200 --> 00:51:26,239
Yusuf Bey will fire the first arrow.

572
00:51:31,880 --> 00:51:34,079
Yusuf.

573
00:51:35,720 --> 00:51:38,519
I will accept you as the
winner if you can hit even once.

574
00:51:40,000 --> 00:51:44,039
You won't even be able to
do that, incompetent man.

575
00:51:45,040 --> 00:51:46,319
Go on.

576
00:52:09,840 --> 00:52:11,759
Yusuf Bey...

577
00:52:12,680 --> 00:52:16,119
...couldn't even hit once.

578
00:52:16,800 --> 00:52:18,839
Now it's my turn.

579
00:52:30,200 --> 00:52:31,719
Are you ready?

580
00:52:34,080 --> 00:52:35,959
Allah is Truthful.

581
00:52:36,280 --> 00:52:37,919
Throw!

582
00:53:02,600 --> 00:53:04,679
Cerkutay Bey.

583
00:53:05,560 --> 00:53:07,559
Okay then.

584
00:53:14,240 --> 00:53:16,599
Allah is Everlasting

585
00:53:20,160 --> 00:53:22,439
Allah is Truthful!

586
00:53:29,320 --> 00:53:35,579
Oh praise be! Well done!

587
00:53:41,400 --> 00:53:44,919
That's a skilled archer.

588
00:53:45,640 --> 00:53:47,599
Come on.

589
00:53:47,720 --> 00:53:50,199
The preparations are complete.

590
00:54:04,680 --> 00:54:07,559
Praise be! Those who
stand with Osman Bey...

591
00:54:07,840 --> 00:54:10,879
...are satisfied with gold and food.

592
00:54:15,720 --> 00:54:18,719
Attention! Osman Bey!

593
00:54:31,240 --> 00:54:33,679
Have a seat.

594
00:54:40,760 --> 00:54:42,239
My Beys.

595
00:54:43,480 --> 00:54:44,919
Sisters.

596
00:54:46,640 --> 00:54:47,799
Brothers.

597
00:54:49,600 --> 00:54:51,599
Shahada is a title..

598
00:54:52,200 --> 00:54:53,999
...and being a Ghazi is a reward.

599
00:54:54,320 --> 00:54:57,759
Our fathers left us
with a duty of conquest.

600
00:54:57,960 --> 00:55:00,919
Thank Allah we have succeeded.

601
00:55:02,080 --> 00:55:03,279
Thank Allah.

602
00:55:03,600 --> 00:55:05,079
Now the duty...

603
00:55:06,840 --> 00:55:09,239
...is to make the Karadin castle...

604
00:55:09,880 --> 00:55:13,359
...a place in our
state, like other tribes.

605
00:55:16,080 --> 00:55:17,359
To do that...

606
00:55:17,920 --> 00:55:20,479
...we need one of our great beylics...

607
00:55:22,040 --> 00:55:24,159
...to take control of...

608
00:55:25,160 --> 00:55:26,999
..Karedin Castle.

609
00:55:29,240 --> 00:55:30,079
Now...

610
00:55:31,280 --> 00:55:33,359
...this sacred duty...

611
00:55:35,560 --> 00:55:38,239
...will be appointed to...

612
00:55:48,720 --> 00:55:50,399
Begum Hatun. It's you.

613
00:56:03,440 --> 00:56:06,639
May Great Allah keep
our great Bey with us.

614
00:56:06,920 --> 00:56:08,119
Thank you.

615
00:56:08,120 --> 00:56:10,609
Tomorrow you and your men..

616
00:56:11,040 --> 00:56:12,799
...will go to Karedin Castle.

617
00:56:12,800 --> 00:56:14,799
You'll be in charge of it.

618
00:56:20,240 --> 00:56:21,559
Alright.

619
00:56:22,000 --> 00:56:24,599
You may start eating.

620
00:56:27,280 --> 00:56:29,559
In the name of Allah.

621
00:56:33,840 --> 00:56:35,759
Don't forget what I said.

622
00:56:35,760 --> 00:56:37,239
You're in trouble.

623
00:56:41,320 --> 00:56:43,239
Enjoy your meal.

624
00:57:06,920 --> 00:57:07,919
Holofira.

625
00:57:20,040 --> 00:57:21,999
My girl. What is it?

626
00:57:26,480 --> 00:57:29,439
I'm here as Commander Lucas' messenger.

627
00:57:33,120 --> 00:57:36,279
He wants to welcome you in the arena...

628
00:57:36,280 --> 00:57:38,279
...and meet you.

629
00:57:44,880 --> 00:57:46,279
I understand.

630
00:57:46,640 --> 00:57:48,559
If I accept...

631
00:57:50,240 --> 00:57:51,559
..I'll go to him.

632
00:57:55,040 --> 00:57:57,039
Come on my girl.

633
00:58:28,320 --> 00:58:30,399
Baysungur. Come brother.

634
00:58:33,600 --> 00:58:37,479
Brother. Alps.
Come on. Hold him.

635
00:58:37,480 --> 00:58:39,479
To the healer's tent.

636
00:58:44,800 --> 00:58:45,639
Gonca.

637
00:58:46,520 --> 00:58:48,759
You haven't eaten anything all day.

638
00:58:48,760 --> 00:58:50,759
Why won't you eat now?

639
00:58:51,000 --> 00:58:53,519
I don't want anything mother.

640
00:58:53,960 --> 00:58:55,839
I haven't been able to eat.

641
00:58:56,000 --> 00:58:58,839
How could she have an appetite?

642
00:59:01,360 --> 00:59:04,399
The castle is haunted.

643
00:59:07,240 --> 00:59:10,279
We all know you're jealous.

644
00:59:11,360 --> 00:59:13,439
Wait for more.

645
00:59:14,920 --> 00:59:19,399
If you keep boasting,
I'll finish what Bey didn't.

646
00:59:19,400 --> 00:59:21,399
I'll kill you.

647
00:59:23,240 --> 00:59:24,199
Girl.

648
00:59:25,240 --> 00:59:30,839
For the glory of this day, bring
my halva with extra pekmez.

649
00:59:32,400 --> 00:59:34,559
We hurt a lot of our enemies.

650
00:59:34,560 --> 00:59:37,559
May we eat something sweet.

651
00:59:50,960 --> 00:59:53,439
Bayhan Bey.

652
00:59:53,640 --> 00:59:56,079
I now owe you a life, huh?

653
00:59:56,080 --> 00:59:58,279
Not at all, my bey.

654
00:59:58,400 --> 00:59:59,719
It's my duty.

655
00:59:59,720 --> 01:00:01,719
Thank you.

656
01:00:37,920 --> 01:00:38,999
No.

657
01:00:41,120 --> 01:00:43,519
You sit down.

658
01:00:43,520 --> 01:00:46,839
Don't get up and continue to eat.

659
01:01:00,440 --> 01:01:02,519
Brother...

660
01:01:03,000 --> 01:01:05,839
All this time we thought...

661
01:01:06,320 --> 01:01:08,879
...you fell martyr.

662
01:01:09,080 --> 01:01:11,599
Where have you been?

663
01:01:15,840 --> 01:01:17,999
Baysungur.

664
01:01:18,680 --> 01:01:19,879
What happened?

665
01:01:19,880 --> 01:01:21,279
Brother.

666
01:01:21,720 --> 01:01:23,519
Who did this to you?

667
01:01:23,520 --> 01:01:24,879
My bey.

668
01:01:25,920 --> 01:01:27,479
Karesi..

669
01:01:28,120 --> 01:01:30,359
Karesi alps, my bey.

670
01:01:30,480 --> 01:01:32,279
Karesi?

671
01:01:32,280 --> 01:01:33,519
Yes.

672
01:01:38,360 --> 01:01:39,719
My bey.

673
01:01:41,120 --> 01:01:42,919
The Vizier.

674
01:01:43,080 --> 01:01:45,759
I know why he came.

675
01:01:45,960 --> 01:01:47,879
What is it?

676
01:01:50,200 --> 01:01:53,399
Sacred relics that was left from..

677
01:01:54,040 --> 01:01:56,639
...our Prophet...

678
01:01:59,440 --> 01:02:01,279
The infidels have it.

679
01:02:01,280 --> 01:02:02,679
What?

680
01:02:09,240 --> 01:02:10,879
How...

681
01:02:31,280 --> 01:02:33,599
Watch where you're going, hatun!

682
01:02:33,600 --> 01:02:36,479
I'm very scared of spiders.

683
01:02:54,560 --> 01:02:58,519
What is that hatun doing in that tent?

684
01:03:08,840 --> 01:03:11,679
It smells very nice.

685
01:03:12,640 --> 01:03:14,519
Even I crave it.

686
01:03:14,520 --> 01:03:16,399
Then you can have the first bite.

687
01:03:16,400 --> 01:03:18,559
Gonca Hatun, you're pregnant.

688
01:03:19,160 --> 01:03:20,399
Enjoy.

689
01:03:20,400 --> 01:03:22,399
Then I'll take it.

690
01:03:22,400 --> 01:03:24,199
Here you go.

691
01:03:30,320 --> 01:03:33,439
Go ahead sister in law, you
haven't eaten anything all day.

692
01:03:33,440 --> 01:03:35,759
I really didn't.

693
01:03:50,240 --> 01:03:52,639
It's very tasty.

694
01:03:52,680 --> 01:03:54,519
Thank you Begum Hatun.

695
01:04:14,760 --> 01:04:18,559
What is it Osman
Bey? Is it bad news?

696
01:04:23,040 --> 01:04:25,479
The sacred relics...

697
01:04:27,400 --> 01:04:29,679
...of Islam have been stolen.

698
01:04:30,680 --> 01:04:31,599
Oh no...

699
01:04:34,520 --> 01:04:37,319
Today is the darkest day
of the muslims, my Bey.

700
01:04:37,320 --> 01:04:39,399
How can we live with this shame?

701
01:04:39,600 --> 01:04:42,679
We can't live with this shame.
It is now our duty to shed blood.

702
01:04:42,680 --> 01:04:44,439
No.

703
01:04:44,680 --> 01:04:48,879
Wait a second, Beys.

704
01:04:49,000 --> 01:04:50,439
We are not dead yet.

705
01:04:51,160 --> 01:04:54,959
So there is still hope for Islam world.

706
01:04:55,600 --> 01:04:57,239
Bayhan Bey.

707
01:04:57,440 --> 01:05:01,239
Did we not make oaths
to fight against the...

708
01:05:01,240 --> 01:05:02,919
..infidels?

709
01:05:02,920 --> 01:05:04,199
We made, my Bey.

710
01:05:04,200 --> 01:05:06,679
Gencer bey, you tell me.

711
01:05:07,680 --> 01:05:10,559
Didn't we say that our
cause will last forever?

712
01:05:10,560 --> 01:05:11,999
We made an oath, my Bey.

713
01:05:12,480 --> 01:05:13,799
Then.

714
01:05:14,720 --> 01:05:16,919
Don't forget your oaths.

715
01:05:19,320 --> 01:05:21,679
We will not fall into despair.

716
01:05:21,920 --> 01:05:23,919
We won't allow the infidels.

717
01:05:24,880 --> 01:05:26,279
If necessary...

718
01:05:27,360 --> 01:05:28,999
...if necessary...

719
01:05:29,680 --> 01:05:32,559
...we will suffer from within...

720
01:05:32,640 --> 01:05:35,399
...but we won't show it to anyone.

721
01:05:39,880 --> 01:05:41,799
Even if they put the relics inside the...

722
01:05:42,880 --> 01:05:44,919
...nest of the scorpion...

723
01:05:45,120 --> 01:05:49,279
...we will go in there and take them all!

724
01:05:49,800 --> 01:05:51,199
If Allah permits my Bey!

725
01:05:51,200 --> 01:05:52,559
If Allah permits my Bey.

726
01:05:54,040 --> 01:05:55,999
We will take them.

727
01:06:07,920 --> 01:06:10,399
Thank Allah.

728
01:06:11,360 --> 01:06:12,839
Gonca.

729
01:06:13,800 --> 01:06:15,559
Are you okay?

730
01:06:17,160 --> 01:06:18,279
I am okay.

731
01:06:18,720 --> 01:06:20,039
What happened?

732
01:06:20,040 --> 01:06:21,079
I am okay.

733
01:06:21,480 --> 01:06:23,359
Come sit down.

734
01:06:23,360 --> 01:06:26,319
-Easy
-In the name of Allah.

735
01:06:28,040 --> 01:06:29,159
What happened?

736
01:06:32,040 --> 01:06:34,839
My stomach burns, Alaeddin.

737
01:06:36,160 --> 01:06:38,679
I didn't eat anything today.

738
01:06:39,600 --> 01:06:40,759
I don't know.

739
01:06:41,000 --> 01:06:42,839
It must be flu.

740
01:06:44,040 --> 01:06:46,079
It must be because you were scared.

741
01:06:46,720 --> 01:06:50,279
I was so scared that
something would happen to you.

742
01:06:53,480 --> 01:06:54,319
What happened?

743
01:06:55,360 --> 01:06:59,199
Look. It is playing.

744
01:07:01,360 --> 01:07:05,119
It must have missed you, just like me.

745
01:07:05,400 --> 01:07:08,079
It can't wait to come out.

746
01:07:10,160 --> 01:07:13,519
Wait there, we will meet soon.

747
01:07:13,880 --> 01:07:16,559
My daisy.

748
01:07:18,520 --> 01:07:20,759
Allah Allah!

749
01:07:22,680 --> 01:07:25,479
You call him "my brave
son" and "my daisy girl".

750
01:07:25,600 --> 01:07:28,399
Make a decision, madrasah student.

751
01:07:29,360 --> 01:07:32,199
But I know why you are doing that.

752
01:07:32,200 --> 01:07:33,359
Why?

753
01:07:33,360 --> 01:07:36,719
When it's born, you will say
that you guessed correctly.

754
01:07:39,040 --> 01:07:41,959
I learned it from you, trickster hatun.

755
01:07:41,960 --> 01:07:43,319
You are right.

756
01:08:30,600 --> 01:08:35,198
If we can't find the sacred relics,
blood will be spilled, Holofira.

757
01:08:35,720 --> 01:08:38,639
The enmity between Greeks
and Muslims will get worse.

758
01:08:38,640 --> 01:08:41,037
I wish we could stop that.

759
01:08:41,319 --> 01:08:43,158
If you hear anything about...

760
01:08:43,760 --> 01:08:45,559
...the relics...

761
01:08:45,800 --> 01:08:48,118
...inform me, okay?

762
01:08:48,960 --> 01:08:50,118
Okay.

763
01:08:52,439 --> 01:08:53,679
Holofira.

764
01:08:55,920 --> 01:08:58,599
That man named Lucas.

765
01:08:58,600 --> 01:09:00,719
Don't trust him.

766
01:09:03,200 --> 01:09:07,719
Commander Lucas is not like
any Byzantine I have ever seen.

767
01:09:07,880 --> 01:09:10,719
He is merciful and fair.

768
01:09:11,800 --> 01:09:13,319
Holofira.

769
01:09:14,640 --> 01:09:16,519
You should heed my warning.

770
01:09:17,279 --> 01:09:18,479
Orhan Bey.

771
01:09:19,680 --> 01:09:22,198
Are you jealous?

772
01:09:22,479 --> 01:09:23,759
Well...

773
01:09:25,640 --> 01:09:27,839
Of course l am jealous.

774
01:09:28,880 --> 01:09:33,319
But it's not just jealousy. I am
sending you to the inn of the enemy.

775
01:09:33,640 --> 01:09:37,439
...if anything happens to you...
-That's my home, Orhan Bey.

776
01:09:39,279 --> 01:09:40,037
No.

777
01:09:42,840 --> 01:09:44,399
Your home..

778
01:09:50,080 --> 01:09:51,839
...is here, Lord's daughter.

779
01:10:32,640 --> 01:10:34,959
In the name of Allah.

780
01:10:45,880 --> 01:10:46,559
Gonca.

781
01:10:48,480 --> 01:10:51,399
Look at you. You shouldn't bother.

782
01:11:01,760 --> 01:11:02,519
Gonca.

783
01:11:04,280 --> 01:11:05,439
Are you okay Gonca?

784
01:11:07,120 --> 01:11:08,079
What happened Gonca?

785
01:11:08,080 --> 01:11:10,959
Baby's coming. It's
coming this time Alaeddin.

786
01:11:11,040 --> 01:11:13,199
Baby? Baby's coming?

787
01:11:13,200 --> 01:11:16,119
Baby's coming. Gonca come.

788
01:11:16,120 --> 01:11:18,119
Come on Gonca. Mother!

789
01:11:18,120 --> 01:11:20,119
Mother! Baby's coming.

790
01:11:21,440 --> 01:11:23,999
Alaeddin.
-Come on.

791
01:11:24,200 --> 01:11:26,079
Prepare the hot water. Come on.

792
01:11:26,400 --> 01:11:27,239
Come on.

793
01:11:27,600 --> 01:11:28,519
Mother!

794
01:11:28,880 --> 01:11:30,519
Mother! Baby's coming!

795
01:11:31,160 --> 01:11:33,719
Time's passing Karesi Bey.

796
01:11:35,200 --> 01:11:38,279
But your Alps didn't sent word.

797
01:11:40,240 --> 01:11:43,199
My Bey. Osman Bey's coming.

798
01:11:52,240 --> 01:11:53,479
Did he hear?

799
01:12:07,800 --> 01:12:09,079
Peace be with you.

800
01:12:10,160 --> 01:12:11,959
Peace be upon you.

801
01:12:12,600 --> 01:12:13,759
Peace be upon you.

802
01:12:31,560 --> 01:12:32,919
Enjoy your meal.

803
01:12:34,160 --> 01:12:36,359
Enjoy your meal.

804
01:12:36,880 --> 01:12:37,799
Thank you.

805
01:12:39,920 --> 01:12:40,839
Osman Bey.

806
01:12:41,040 --> 01:12:43,479
What made you...

807
01:12:44,720 --> 01:12:47,439
...get in your ship and come here?

808
01:12:47,760 --> 01:12:49,239
The Vizier Hadrath..

809
01:12:50,560 --> 01:12:53,919
...came to the borders for a reason.

810
01:12:56,840 --> 01:12:58,159
That's why I'm here.

811
01:13:05,400 --> 01:13:06,239
Vizier Hadrath.

812
01:13:07,840 --> 01:13:09,639
We invited you.

813
01:13:10,600 --> 01:13:12,519
You didn't come.

814
01:13:13,400 --> 01:13:14,879
It's okay.

815
01:13:19,920 --> 01:13:23,159
Most sacred Islam relics are stolen.

816
01:13:24,600 --> 01:13:25,559
You...

817
01:13:26,040 --> 01:13:28,279
...discriminate among Beys.

818
01:13:30,800 --> 01:13:34,199
And you kept it from us. Why?

819
01:13:34,880 --> 01:13:36,399
Islam world..

820
01:13:37,960 --> 01:13:41,079
...and the Caliph's
honor must be protected.

821
01:13:42,640 --> 01:13:45,999
We disgraced Allah and His Prophet.

822
01:13:47,000 --> 01:13:48,959
There is nothing worse than that.

823
01:13:55,960 --> 01:13:58,559
Anyways.

824
01:13:59,760 --> 01:14:00,559
So...

825
01:14:01,240 --> 01:14:03,199
...Caliph Hadrath...

826
01:14:04,360 --> 01:14:06,519
Does he have known enemies?

827
01:14:07,480 --> 01:14:08,759
Who would steal them?

828
01:14:09,640 --> 01:14:12,199
They looked like monks.

829
01:14:13,440 --> 01:14:17,079
I think they are members of a cult.

830
01:14:20,160 --> 01:14:22,559
But that's all we know about it.

831
01:14:24,480 --> 01:14:28,799
The Vizier Hadrath was
chased to the Borders but...

832
01:14:28,800 --> 01:14:32,279
..the moment he lost them..

833
01:14:32,720 --> 01:14:36,359
...he came to the most
powerful of these lands...

834
01:14:37,040 --> 01:14:39,919
...which means, to us.

835
01:14:40,600 --> 01:14:43,679
So your powers are not enough...

836
01:14:43,800 --> 01:14:45,919
...Karesi Bey.

837
01:14:47,680 --> 01:14:50,679
Where are you looking
for the monks, tell me.

838
01:14:51,200 --> 01:14:56,439
All the monasteries and
the churches around here.

839
01:14:59,000 --> 01:15:00,639
Where else would I look for them?

840
01:15:00,640 --> 01:15:03,639
Monks don't always stay at the churches.

841
01:15:03,880 --> 01:15:06,159
Just like our dervishes..

842
01:15:06,160 --> 01:15:08,559
At the fields, at the caves...

843
01:15:08,800 --> 01:15:12,199
They live in seclusion
when it comes to that too.

844
01:15:22,280 --> 01:15:25,039
We're going to look for them together.

845
01:15:28,000 --> 01:15:30,559
We're already searching for them.

846
01:15:30,560 --> 01:15:33,359
If you're so keen...

847
01:15:34,360 --> 01:15:36,439
...you can look for them yourself.

848
01:15:44,880 --> 01:15:48,399
Even for such an important
thing you divide us.

849
01:15:48,800 --> 01:15:51,359
Karesi Bey...

850
01:15:54,960 --> 01:15:57,199
Shame on you.

851
01:15:59,680 --> 01:16:01,559
Shame on you.

852
01:16:14,280 --> 01:16:17,359
In the name of Allah, the most
merciful, the most beneficent.

853
01:16:29,600 --> 01:16:32,719
It looks like if I don't
find it, Lucas will.

854
01:16:33,080 --> 01:16:35,999
And if Lucas doesn't..

855
01:16:37,640 --> 01:16:40,719
...Osman Bey will.

856
01:16:49,000 --> 01:16:51,399
Let Sancar know.

857
01:16:51,480 --> 01:16:57,239
Some of them will look everywhere,
the fields and the caves too.

858
01:16:57,680 --> 01:16:59,479
And the others...

859
01:17:00,160 --> 01:17:02,839
...will follow Osman.

860
01:17:02,840 --> 01:17:04,959
As you wish my bey.

861
01:17:09,920 --> 01:17:11,599
Osman.

862
01:17:11,600 --> 01:17:15,399
You are as smart as you are strong.

863
01:17:15,600 --> 01:17:18,039
If you swore loyalty to me...

864
01:17:18,320 --> 01:17:22,239
...we would have shook the world together.

865
01:17:23,840 --> 01:17:25,359
Come on girl.

866
01:17:25,360 --> 01:17:27,079
-Hold on, daughter.
-Come on.

867
01:17:27,080 --> 01:17:29,089
-My grandchild is coming.
-Come on girl.

868
01:17:33,800 --> 01:17:36,759
No mother I can't do this.

869
01:17:36,760 --> 01:17:38,719
-You are nearly there, daughter!
-I can't mother.

870
01:17:38,720 --> 01:17:41,279
Hold on. In the name of Allah, the
most merciful, the most beneficent.

871
01:17:41,280 --> 01:17:44,099
-It is coming.
-She's burning up, there's something wrong.

872
01:17:44,099 --> 01:17:45,559
Come on girl.

873
01:17:51,040 --> 01:17:54,319
Come on Gonca.

874
01:18:04,680 --> 01:18:06,159
She'll be okay.

875
01:18:06,160 --> 01:18:07,359
Brother.

876
01:18:07,400 --> 01:18:09,479
She will be.

877
01:18:12,360 --> 01:18:13,919
-Mother.
-Mother.

878
01:18:13,920 --> 01:18:15,439
Mother is the baby born?

879
01:18:15,440 --> 01:18:17,119
No, girl.

880
01:18:17,120 --> 01:18:19,719
Alaeddin. Gonca is not okay son.

881
01:18:19,720 --> 01:18:23,079
She has a fever, her eyes
are bloodshot, her lips are dry.

882
01:18:23,080 --> 01:18:25,399
This isn't about the birth.

883
01:18:29,640 --> 01:18:30,959
-Hold on.
-Let me check mother.

884
01:18:30,960 --> 01:18:33,519
-Come on.
-The baby is here.

885
01:18:33,520 --> 01:18:35,439
The baby is here.

886
01:18:35,920 --> 01:18:36,919
Mother.

887
01:18:37,920 --> 01:18:39,399
Come on.

888
01:18:44,240 --> 01:18:45,519
Gonca.

889
01:18:53,160 --> 01:18:54,959
Thank Allah.

890
01:18:55,080 --> 01:18:55,879
Gonca.

891
01:18:55,880 --> 01:18:57,959
Good news my Shahzade.

892
01:18:57,960 --> 01:19:00,519
-You have a daughter.
-Thank Allah.

893
01:19:00,520 --> 01:19:02,199
Thank Allah.

894
01:19:04,040 --> 01:19:05,079
Alaeddin.

895
01:19:05,080 --> 01:19:06,639
Thank Allah, Gonca.

896
01:19:06,640 --> 01:19:08,919
Why isn't she crying?

897
01:19:10,320 --> 01:19:11,679
My baby...

898
01:19:12,120 --> 01:19:14,479
Give her to me.

899
01:19:18,800 --> 01:19:20,799
Come on girl.

900
01:19:21,040 --> 01:19:21,799
Come on.

901
01:19:21,800 --> 01:19:24,559
-Mother...
-Come on girl.

902
01:19:24,840 --> 01:19:27,759
Come on. Come on dear.

903
01:19:33,000 --> 01:19:36,039
In the name of Allah, the most
merciful, the most beneficent.

904
01:19:37,320 --> 01:19:40,559
Come on my dear.

905
01:19:40,560 --> 01:19:42,679
Come on! In the name of Allah, the
most merciful, the most beneficent.

906
01:19:42,680 --> 01:19:45,239
Mother, why is my baby not crying?

907
01:19:45,240 --> 01:19:48,719
Alaeddin do something?
Why isn't she crying?

908
01:19:48,720 --> 01:19:51,159
Alaeddin, do something!

909
01:19:52,040 --> 01:19:53,799
No! No!

910
01:19:54,320 --> 01:19:56,279
No, darling!

911
01:19:56,720 --> 01:20:00,359
Come on, my daisy.

912
01:20:01,520 --> 01:20:03,479
My baby.
-Come on!

913
01:20:03,480 --> 01:20:07,239
-Come on my baby!
-Alaeddin, give her to me.

914
01:20:07,440 --> 01:20:12,039
Something's happening, my shahzade!

915
01:20:13,360 --> 01:20:13,999
Gonca!

916
01:20:14,000 --> 01:20:15,519
Alaeddin, turn her over!

917
01:20:15,600 --> 01:20:16,679
Turn her over!

918
01:20:16,680 --> 01:20:17,879
Gonca!

919
01:20:18,280 --> 01:20:19,639
Her mouth is dry.

920
01:20:19,720 --> 01:20:21,919
She said her stomach was
burning, and her arm was cold.

921
01:20:24,480 --> 01:20:26,999
Mother! She is poisoned!

922
01:20:27,000 --> 01:20:28,959
Poison?

923
01:20:29,040 --> 01:20:30,359
She is poisoned!

924
01:20:30,360 --> 01:20:32,439
That's wolfsbane!

925
01:20:32,440 --> 01:20:34,199
Kismet!

926
01:20:34,320 --> 01:20:38,479
Kismwt, bring milk, honey and black
sesame! I will prepare an antidote!

927
01:20:38,760 --> 01:20:40,679
Come on!

928
01:20:40,680 --> 01:20:43,599
Gonca, you will be okay.

929
01:20:43,600 --> 01:20:44,879
Ulgen, she will throw up first.

930
01:20:45,080 --> 01:20:46,839
She will throw up first.
I will make the antidote.

931
01:20:46,880 --> 01:20:48,159
I will.

932
01:20:48,160 --> 01:20:53,119
I will make the antidote.

933
01:21:44,600 --> 01:21:47,199
Ulgen, Kismet, Guice.

934
01:21:47,320 --> 01:21:51,359
You will learn what Gonca
ate and drank yesterday.

935
01:21:51,840 --> 01:21:54,119
She felt sick all day.

936
01:21:54,120 --> 01:21:56,799
Yeah, she didn't eat
anything I brought her.

937
01:21:56,800 --> 01:21:58,519
She didn't even drink water.

938
01:21:58,880 --> 01:22:00,799
She must have eaten something.

939
01:22:00,800 --> 01:22:02,199
Think carefully.

940
01:22:09,720 --> 01:22:12,159
-Son.
-Brother.

941
01:22:16,600 --> 01:22:17,759
How is Gonca?

942
01:22:18,120 --> 01:22:20,119
I gave her the antidote.

943
01:22:20,840 --> 01:22:22,749
She will be okay, if Allah permits.

944
01:22:25,960 --> 01:22:28,199
Gonca ate some of my halva yesterday.

945
01:22:29,600 --> 01:22:33,319
Yeah, She craved for it.

946
01:22:33,400 --> 01:22:35,319
But that halva was made for me.

947
01:22:35,360 --> 01:22:37,479
The one who put the poison
must have wanted to kill me.

948
01:22:37,880 --> 01:22:40,119
What are you trying to say, Begum Hatun.

949
01:22:40,880 --> 01:22:42,839
Hazal did it!

950
01:22:44,360 --> 01:22:46,639
She did it because Osman
Bey gave the castle to me!

951
01:22:46,640 --> 01:22:50,319
You snake! That's a lie!

952
01:22:50,320 --> 01:22:51,799
Tevbeh!

953
01:22:52,040 --> 01:22:53,919
It's a slander, Bala Hatun!

954
01:22:53,920 --> 01:22:55,199
Stop denying it Hazal!

955
01:22:55,320 --> 01:22:57,959
You said you wanted to kill me!

956
01:22:58,600 --> 01:22:59,999
Enough!

957
01:23:00,640 --> 01:23:01,839
Enough!

958
01:23:02,240 --> 01:23:03,519
I didn't do it.

959
01:23:04,000 --> 01:23:05,159
I didn't do it.

960
01:23:06,880 --> 01:23:11,679
Begum Hatun, did someone
else hear Hazal Hatun saying that?

961
01:23:12,480 --> 01:23:13,959
I heard it.

962
01:23:14,280 --> 01:23:17,559
Hazal Hatun threatened Begum Hatun.

963
01:23:18,080 --> 01:23:20,839
Mother, I heard it too.

964
01:23:23,880 --> 01:23:27,479
You heard it. They want to kill my sister.

965
01:23:33,320 --> 01:23:34,679
Kismet.

966
01:23:35,240 --> 01:23:38,919
Interrogate all of Bayhan
Bey's alps. Search their tents.

967
01:23:39,200 --> 01:23:39,839
Come on.

968
01:23:39,840 --> 01:23:41,599
How could you do that Bala Hatun?

969
01:23:41,880 --> 01:23:43,999
-Words spoken with anger...
-Shut up!

970
01:23:44,000 --> 01:23:45,119
Alaeddin.

971
01:23:47,080 --> 01:23:49,359
It was my daughter that died!

972
01:23:49,360 --> 01:23:50,719
You are not to talk!

973
01:23:50,720 --> 01:23:52,239
Alaeddin!

974
01:23:52,240 --> 01:23:54,079
Their tents will be searched.

975
01:23:54,200 --> 01:23:55,679
I didn't accuse anyone.

976
01:23:56,440 --> 01:23:59,879
Until the investigation is
over, no one will leave the tribe.

977
01:24:00,680 --> 01:24:01,679
Brother.

978
01:24:02,040 --> 01:24:04,359
It's okay.

979
01:24:05,120 --> 01:24:08,959
Come on.
-Come on.

980
01:24:09,400 --> 01:24:12,159
Come on, son.
-I didn't do it!

981
01:24:12,760 --> 01:24:14,599
Black Widow!

982
01:24:15,720 --> 01:24:17,199
Let go!

983
01:24:22,200 --> 01:24:24,399
I want this to be our
last separation, Holofira.

984
01:24:31,840 --> 01:24:33,759
Orhan.

985
01:24:35,720 --> 01:24:38,279
Do you still keep this necklace?

986
01:24:39,240 --> 01:24:40,919
Not just this.

987
01:24:46,000 --> 01:24:46,679
I...

988
01:24:48,040 --> 01:24:49,199
...kept you..

989
01:24:51,560 --> 01:24:54,199
...in my heart all this
time, Lord's daughter.

990
01:24:55,880 --> 01:24:56,819
My...

991
01:24:57,880 --> 01:25:00,839
...biggest test in this life...

992
01:25:04,480 --> 01:25:05,839
..was to live without you.

993
01:25:08,280 --> 01:25:12,159
My hardest battle was to leave you...

994
01:25:12,520 --> 01:25:14,759
...for my state.

995
01:25:16,040 --> 01:25:16,919
But...

996
01:25:17,760 --> 01:25:18,999
But fate...

997
01:25:19,680 --> 01:25:21,479
...has brought together...

998
01:25:21,800 --> 01:25:23,799
...for the third time, Lord's daughter.

999
01:25:26,160 --> 01:25:26,879
I'm yours...

1000
01:25:27,960 --> 01:25:29,919
...and your mine.

1001
01:25:31,040 --> 01:25:33,119
The first time I saw you...

1002
01:25:33,720 --> 01:25:37,319
...the first day I saw
you, I fell in love.

1003
01:25:40,080 --> 01:25:41,959
We were so little.

1004
01:25:43,000 --> 01:25:46,919
My small heart fell for you day by day.

1005
01:25:50,680 --> 01:25:52,199
Let's not be apart.

1006
01:25:54,480 --> 01:25:55,599
Let's be together.

1007
01:26:00,680 --> 01:26:01,719
Holofira.

1008
01:26:05,280 --> 01:26:06,799
Will you marry me?

1009
01:26:14,320 --> 01:26:15,359
Orhan.

1010
01:26:16,640 --> 01:26:17,599
I...

1011
01:26:18,360 --> 01:26:20,159
After all this time?
-I know...

1012
01:26:21,360 --> 01:26:23,199
I know it's sudden.

1013
01:26:23,440 --> 01:26:25,319
But I....

1014
01:26:25,480 --> 01:26:27,719
I don't have the patience...

1015
01:26:28,320 --> 01:26:30,399
..to live without you anymore.

1016
01:26:32,520 --> 01:26:34,199
Let's talk, Lord's daughter.

1017
01:26:49,320 --> 01:26:51,719
Wait for my answer then.

1018
01:26:52,240 --> 01:26:53,239
Okay.

1019
01:26:54,080 --> 01:26:56,359
As long as you say yes.

1020
01:26:57,960 --> 01:26:59,639
I'll wait for a life time.

1021
01:27:02,080 --> 01:27:04,479
A life time Holofira.

1022
01:27:32,840 --> 01:27:33,679
Come on.

1023
01:27:34,800 --> 01:27:36,279
Lord's daughter.

1024
01:27:37,040 --> 01:27:37,799
I know it.

1025
01:27:38,720 --> 01:27:40,759
We paid our dues.

1026
01:27:41,160 --> 01:27:42,619
We'll be together now.

1027
01:27:43,680 --> 01:27:44,879
Now...

1028
01:27:45,680 --> 01:27:47,119
...we'll be happy.

1029
01:27:50,280 --> 01:27:50,799
Come on.

1030
01:28:15,320 --> 01:28:18,679
The Turk I heard about in Constantinople.

1031
01:28:22,160 --> 01:28:24,039
Osman Bey.

1032
01:28:30,320 --> 01:28:32,279
Finally we met.

1033
01:28:34,200 --> 01:28:35,439
Holofira told me.

1034
01:28:36,360 --> 01:28:38,359
You wanted to talk.

1035
01:28:38,360 --> 01:28:41,039
Thanks for coming. Have a seat.

1036
01:28:41,040 --> 01:28:43,039
They're for you.

1037
01:28:57,440 --> 01:28:59,279
We're not here to eat and drink.

1038
01:29:06,280 --> 01:29:07,799
Commander Lucas.

1039
01:29:11,440 --> 01:29:12,399
I'm listening.

1040
01:29:14,000 --> 01:29:15,679
I wanted to meet you.

1041
01:29:16,480 --> 01:29:21,439
Because I always want to
meet my enemies before battle.

1042
01:29:23,400 --> 01:29:24,639
Is that so?

1043
01:29:25,960 --> 01:29:27,079
Okay then.

1044
01:29:27,600 --> 01:29:28,799
Let's meet.

1045
01:29:32,680 --> 01:29:35,159
Before we battle.

1046
01:29:38,040 --> 01:29:39,679
By the way...

1047
01:29:39,680 --> 01:29:42,599
...should I call you monk Lucas?

1048
01:29:49,480 --> 01:29:52,359
You came to Bursa in a monk disguise.

1049
01:29:52,480 --> 01:29:54,359
Are you wearing a...

1050
01:29:54,640 --> 01:29:56,679
...monk's tunic...

1051
01:29:57,200 --> 01:29:59,039
...or...

1052
01:29:59,160 --> 01:30:01,639
...the clothes of a commander?

1053
01:30:02,120 --> 01:30:06,039
When it's needed I'm a
poor monk of our religion...

1054
01:30:06,040 --> 01:30:11,479
...and when it's needed I'm the great
commander of our nation, Osman Bey.

1055
01:30:11,480 --> 01:30:15,359
From Caliph Hadrath's palace...

1056
01:30:15,440 --> 01:30:18,799
...our relics were stolen.
When it happened...

1057
01:30:19,840 --> 01:30:22,319
...tell me if you had...

1058
01:30:22,520 --> 01:30:24,119
...the clothes of a monk on or not.

1059
01:30:24,400 --> 01:30:26,799
I don't know what you're talking about.

1060
01:30:27,080 --> 01:30:30,439
But, a monk and a thief...

1061
01:30:30,640 --> 01:30:33,359
...cannot be said in the same sentence.

1062
01:30:33,360 --> 01:30:36,839
You're looking for the things
you lost at the wrong place.

1063
01:30:38,080 --> 01:30:40,239
You say that...

1064
01:30:40,840 --> 01:30:42,519
Okay.

1065
01:30:44,360 --> 01:30:47,679
Don't you dare be the one behind this.

1066
01:30:49,200 --> 01:30:51,359
If you are...

1067
01:30:53,120 --> 01:30:56,439
...then you'll meet my sword.

1068
01:31:00,760 --> 01:31:03,559
We don't need excuses for that.

1069
01:31:03,840 --> 01:31:06,039
I can't wait for the day our swords...

1070
01:31:06,040 --> 01:31:07,799
..meet each other.

1071
01:31:07,800 --> 01:31:09,519
Just you wait.

1072
01:31:09,680 --> 01:31:11,439
Of course, just wait.

1073
01:31:12,680 --> 01:31:14,519
Wait...

1074
01:31:14,600 --> 01:31:16,159
Let me see you off Osman Bey.

1075
01:31:16,160 --> 01:31:17,479
No...

1076
01:31:27,720 --> 01:31:30,199
They had monk clothes on.

1077
01:31:30,200 --> 01:31:31,799
May God bless you.

1078
01:31:31,800 --> 01:31:35,599
I think they belong in a cult but...

1079
01:31:35,600 --> 01:31:38,679
...we don't have anything else either.

1080
01:31:47,720 --> 01:31:49,599
No need.

1081
01:31:52,560 --> 01:31:54,799
We'll leave on our own.

1082
01:32:04,520 --> 01:32:06,799
Those who stole the relics...

1083
01:32:06,800 --> 01:32:08,439
I don't know if it's Lucas.

1084
01:32:08,720 --> 01:32:11,559
But the one next to him,
Magnus or whatever his name is...

1085
01:32:11,560 --> 01:32:14,159
He might be in it.

1086
01:32:14,400 --> 01:32:16,799
The monk that came up to us at the castle.

1087
01:32:16,800 --> 01:32:19,799
He has the same ring as him.

1088
01:32:25,320 --> 01:32:28,319
They might belong to the
cult the Vizier talked about.

1089
01:32:28,440 --> 01:32:29,239
Cerkutay.

1090
01:32:29,240 --> 01:32:30,199
My bey.

1091
01:32:30,200 --> 01:32:32,399
Go and bring me that monk.

1092
01:32:41,720 --> 01:32:44,079
We found this Bala Hatun.

1093
01:32:45,880 --> 01:32:48,759
It looks like poison but I don't know.

1094
01:32:48,760 --> 01:32:50,279
It was under a pillow.

1095
01:32:50,280 --> 01:32:51,719
Lies.

1096
01:32:57,680 --> 01:32:59,639
It's poison.

1097
01:33:01,560 --> 01:33:03,999
He is the one who poisoned my Gonca.

1098
01:33:04,000 --> 01:33:05,519
Bayhan Bey.

1099
01:33:05,520 --> 01:33:07,199
Bayhan Bey, let me go brother.

1100
01:33:07,200 --> 01:33:08,519
Let me go brother.

1101
01:33:08,520 --> 01:33:10,279
They're playing a trick Alaeddin Bey.

1102
01:33:10,280 --> 01:33:12,719
My wife wouldn't do that.

1103
01:33:12,720 --> 01:33:15,199
The poison was found in
her tent yet you still talk.

1104
01:33:15,200 --> 01:33:18,119
This is where words have
no meaning Bayhan Bey.

1105
01:33:18,120 --> 01:33:20,039
Let me go brother.

1106
01:33:20,320 --> 01:33:23,679
Brother let me go.

1107
01:33:23,680 --> 01:33:25,679
Let me go brother.

1108
01:33:25,680 --> 01:33:27,439
Let go.

1109
01:33:33,200 --> 01:33:35,319
Brother let me go.

1110
01:33:35,320 --> 01:33:37,919
-Alaeddin.
-Bayhan Bey.

1111
01:33:37,920 --> 01:33:40,079
When you can fight like a proper person...

1112
01:33:40,080 --> 01:33:41,879
...you chose the poison like the devil.

1113
01:33:41,880 --> 01:33:43,559
You took a baby's life.

1114
01:33:43,560 --> 01:33:46,079
You can't be good.

1115
01:33:46,600 --> 01:33:48,399
You did it.

1116
01:33:48,600 --> 01:33:52,679
the scapegoat you snake.
-Mother.

1117
01:33:52,680 --> 01:33:55,559
-Mother, come here!
-Snake!

1118
01:33:59,000 --> 01:34:01,319
Enough. We'll investigate.

1119
01:34:01,440 --> 01:34:03,599
Take Hazal Hatun to the holding tent.

1120
01:34:04,000 --> 01:34:05,999
I didn't do anything.

1121
01:34:06,000 --> 01:34:07,479
Bala Hatun.

1122
01:34:07,480 --> 01:34:09,119
Take her to the tent.

1123
01:34:09,120 --> 01:34:10,959
Come on. Take her.

1124
01:34:10,960 --> 01:34:12,599
-Quick.
-Bayhan.

1125
01:34:12,600 --> 01:34:14,679
Let me go brother.

1126
01:34:14,680 --> 01:34:16,799
-Let me go.
-Alaeddin.

1127
01:34:16,800 --> 01:34:22,319
I swear neither I nor my wife
have anything to do with this.

1128
01:34:22,320 --> 01:34:25,079
This is just slander, Alaeddin Bey.

1129
01:34:25,080 --> 01:34:27,119
Besides...

1130
01:34:27,120 --> 01:34:29,319
...is this how you repay your owed life?

1131
01:34:29,320 --> 01:34:30,759
He's still talking.

1132
01:34:30,760 --> 01:34:33,079
If you have something to do with this...

1133
01:34:33,080 --> 01:34:35,239
If you do...

1134
01:34:35,240 --> 01:34:37,989
-I'll make you pay dearly, Bayhan Bey.
-Alaeddin.

1135
01:34:38,920 --> 01:34:41,439
Alaeddin.
I told you to stop now!!

1136
01:34:43,120 --> 01:34:45,079
Whoever did this...

1137
01:34:45,520 --> 01:34:47,159
...will die!

1138
01:34:52,840 --> 01:34:53,599
But first...

1139
01:34:54,800 --> 01:34:56,719
First we'll make sure brother.

1140
01:34:58,000 --> 01:34:58,799
Ayhan Bey.

1141
01:34:59,440 --> 01:35:03,919
Until we make a decision you
and your son won't leave the tribe.

1142
01:35:03,920 --> 01:35:05,279
Come.

1143
01:35:08,960 --> 01:35:12,079
Let me go! Let me go!

1144
01:35:13,560 --> 01:35:17,319
My baby died!

1145
01:35:17,640 --> 01:35:18,919
Osman's ambitious.

1146
01:35:20,160 --> 01:35:23,959
Karesi is an old wolf. But they're blind.

1147
01:35:24,840 --> 01:35:27,719
They don't know what's waiting.

1148
01:35:30,040 --> 01:35:31,359
Arrogance Lucas.

1149
01:35:32,120 --> 01:35:34,719
God's deadly poison.

1150
01:35:36,800 --> 01:35:38,479
What's your decision Commander.

1151
01:35:39,440 --> 01:35:41,119
Who will you give the relics?

1152
01:35:41,960 --> 01:35:44,559
The arrogant one of course.

1153
01:35:45,640 --> 01:35:46,959
To Karesi.

1154
01:35:50,080 --> 01:35:55,359
In return, he'll get
Osman's eyes off Bithynia.

1155
01:35:55,920 --> 01:35:57,719
Osman and Karesi..

1156
01:35:59,480 --> 01:36:01,919
...will tear each other apart.

1157
01:36:02,200 --> 01:36:04,199
Exactly what I want.

1158
01:36:06,920 --> 01:36:11,079
To war and Turk's hell!

1159
01:36:39,880 --> 01:36:42,559
You work too hard.

1160
01:36:43,000 --> 01:36:47,599
Lucas must reward you for your hard work.

1161
01:36:48,120 --> 01:36:49,839
War...

1162
01:36:50,840 --> 01:36:53,159
...is a matter of power and strength;

1163
01:37:01,200 --> 01:37:02,839
I am successful..

1164
01:37:04,760 --> 01:37:07,559
...because I expect no reward.

1165
01:37:08,560 --> 01:37:13,199
Without doubt you are a wise man.

1166
01:37:14,960 --> 01:37:16,639
The sacred relics of the Muslims...

1167
01:37:17,120 --> 01:37:19,999
...were stolen.

1168
01:37:20,920 --> 01:37:24,239
In the eyes of a just and
fair commander like you...

1169
01:37:24,760 --> 01:37:27,679
...that must be a despicable thing to do.

1170
01:37:31,800 --> 01:37:35,599
Who could have done that?

1171
01:37:38,000 --> 01:37:40,119
I am sure it will be revealed.

1172
01:37:47,360 --> 01:37:50,639
Now excuse me. I need to work.

1173
01:38:06,880 --> 01:38:09,959
General. Prepare the soldiers.

1174
01:38:10,440 --> 01:38:12,959
We will hit the road for the delivery.

1175
01:38:19,720 --> 01:38:21,519
May peace and mercy of Allah be upon you.

1176
01:38:23,120 --> 01:38:25,799
May peace and mercy of Allah be upon you.

1177
01:38:26,160 --> 01:38:28,359
Oh Allah.

1178
01:38:33,840 --> 01:38:35,399
Amen.

1179
01:38:42,640 --> 01:38:44,599
Oh Allah.

1180
01:38:45,480 --> 01:38:47,759
I wore my armed.

1181
01:38:48,120 --> 01:38:50,279
I took my sword.

1182
01:38:51,000 --> 01:38:56,119
I left the wordly things
behind, and came to you.

1183
01:38:57,600 --> 01:38:58,999
Oh Allah...

1184
01:38:59,760 --> 01:39:04,279
...we are your weapons on earth.

1185
01:39:05,920 --> 01:39:08,319
We will cut the tongue that would...

1186
01:39:08,640 --> 01:39:14,679
...insult You and your prophet, oh Allah.

1187
01:39:16,760 --> 01:39:19,879
Oh Allah...

1188
01:39:20,920 --> 01:39:24,439
...this poor servant of Yours...

1189
01:39:25,240 --> 01:39:26,879
...make him successful.

1190
01:39:28,360 --> 01:39:31,159
Give us hope, oh Allah.

1191
01:39:32,520 --> 01:39:37,679
Allow us to cut the hands that
tried to harm the relics of the Islam.

1192
01:39:38,720 --> 01:39:43,919
Allow us to find us
those relics, oh Allah.

1193
01:39:44,360 --> 01:39:48,119
Allow us to spill blood...

1194
01:39:48,120 --> 01:39:51,279
...die, or even...

1195
01:39:53,440 --> 01:39:56,159
...destroy the whole world..

1196
01:39:57,840 --> 01:40:00,479
..for this cause.

1197
01:40:01,320 --> 01:40:03,839
Allow us, oh Allah.

1198
01:40:06,320 --> 01:40:09,239
Amen.

1199
01:40:12,920 --> 01:40:14,279
In the name of Allah...

1200
01:40:23,160 --> 01:40:25,759
-Boran.
-My Bey.

1201
01:40:32,880 --> 01:40:35,559
We will meet Cerkutay at dawn.

1202
01:40:35,880 --> 01:40:37,759
As you command my Bey.

1203
01:40:46,240 --> 01:40:48,559
-Ambush!
-Protect the monk!

1204
01:40:54,520 --> 01:40:56,879
Let go of the monk, Cerkutay.

1205
01:40:58,280 --> 01:41:00,119
He'll come with me.

1206
01:41:01,000 --> 01:41:03,159
Well...

1207
01:41:04,360 --> 01:41:06,559
Get your dogs off my way.

1208
01:41:06,560 --> 01:41:08,559
Or I'll hurt you.

1209
01:41:09,600 --> 01:41:10,799
Alps!

1210
01:41:18,360 --> 01:41:20,799
So you won't listen.

1211
01:41:20,920 --> 01:41:22,119
Okay.

1212
01:41:22,600 --> 01:41:24,599
Your Alps will be wasted.

1213
01:41:24,840 --> 01:41:27,399
We'll see who'll get wasted.

1214
01:41:27,720 --> 01:41:29,839
They won't let us pass.

1215
01:41:30,120 --> 01:41:31,959
We can't kill them.

1216
01:41:32,240 --> 01:41:36,159
I'll stall. You get on a horse.

1217
01:41:36,400 --> 01:41:37,719
Tell my Bey.

1218
01:41:41,200 --> 01:41:42,799
Then..

1219
01:41:43,840 --> 01:41:45,119
Now...

1220
01:41:49,840 --> 01:41:50,399
I...

1221
01:41:51,240 --> 01:41:52,239
...say that...

1222
01:41:58,120 --> 01:42:00,479
Alps! Attack!

1223
01:42:05,160 --> 01:42:06,399
Cerkutay.

1224
01:42:07,200 --> 01:42:08,839
Wait for your turn.

1225
01:42:18,240 --> 01:42:20,799
First you'll talk, monk!

1226
01:42:21,760 --> 01:42:24,959
Where are the relics? Speak.

1227
01:42:55,440 --> 01:42:57,279
I hope this will help you.

1228
01:42:57,680 --> 01:42:59,519
May God be with you Orhan.

1229
01:43:21,240 --> 01:43:23,599
My Bey. He's Cerkutay's Alp.

1230
01:43:26,520 --> 01:43:28,399
What happened? Hey you.

1231
01:43:28,800 --> 01:43:30,399
Are you okay?

1232
01:43:30,840 --> 01:43:32,399
Where's the monk?

1233
01:43:32,560 --> 01:43:34,399
Who did this?

1234
01:43:35,040 --> 01:43:37,839
Karesi Bey's alps. They caught us.

1235
01:43:44,680 --> 01:43:47,519
Come on. Heal him.

1236
01:43:47,960 --> 01:43:49,359
Get him up.

1237
01:43:49,680 --> 01:43:50,599
Come.

1238
01:43:57,720 --> 01:43:58,719
Karesi Bey.

1239
01:43:59,520 --> 01:44:03,199
Relics are still gone but
he's waging another war.

1240
01:44:05,600 --> 01:44:06,719
Bring the horse.

1241
01:44:15,960 --> 01:44:17,119
Follow me.

1242
01:44:26,000 --> 01:44:28,959
Karesioglu Beylic

1243
01:44:31,680 --> 01:44:33,879
Bey. Commander Lucas is here.

1244
01:44:34,640 --> 01:44:35,359
Let him in.

1245
01:44:49,840 --> 01:44:52,079
I hope you have good news.

1246
01:45:05,320 --> 01:45:07,999
Did you find our relics Lucas?

1247
01:45:08,520 --> 01:45:10,399
Relics are stolen by...

1248
01:45:10,400 --> 01:45:15,479
...a cult that aims to make Christians
and Muslims destroy one another.

1249
01:45:16,440 --> 01:45:19,199
But don't worry. They won't make it.

1250
01:45:19,320 --> 01:45:20,519
Who are they?

1251
01:45:21,280 --> 01:45:24,079
Where do they keep the relics?

1252
01:45:24,560 --> 01:45:27,359
Go there right now...

1253
01:45:27,360 --> 01:45:29,359
...and tear up the place.

1254
01:45:30,160 --> 01:45:35,399
My men will raid the monastery
of the cult and bring you the relics.

1255
01:45:40,760 --> 01:45:44,639
They told me you were strong and wise.

1256
01:45:45,280 --> 01:45:46,919
They're right.

1257
01:45:47,520 --> 01:45:48,759
It's your turn.

1258
01:45:50,720 --> 01:45:51,759
Osman...

1259
01:45:52,600 --> 01:45:54,439
...is our mutual problem.

1260
01:45:55,280 --> 01:45:58,639
Neither you want him to grow stronger...

1261
01:45:58,640 --> 01:46:01,639
...nor I want him to attack my walls.

1262
01:46:01,760 --> 01:46:05,279
Don't worry about Osman.

1263
01:46:05,680 --> 01:46:09,519
It's not even an issue for me to stop him.

1264
01:46:09,720 --> 01:46:14,799
I don't doubt a promise from such
a powerful bey like you is in vein.

1265
01:46:16,360 --> 01:46:19,879
The relics will be in your
hands before the sunset.

1266
01:46:19,960 --> 01:46:21,719
Karesi Bey.

1267
01:46:35,920 --> 01:46:39,399
Talk, where are the sacred relics?

1268
01:46:40,200 --> 01:46:42,079
Tell me and your pain will end.

1269
01:46:42,080 --> 01:46:44,399
Hold on monk.

1270
01:46:46,600 --> 01:46:48,279
You're still holding on.

1271
01:46:48,340 --> 01:46:50,359
Alps, break his bones now!

1272
01:46:52,760 --> 01:46:56,679
-Brother he's going to die.
-Not before he speaks.

1273
01:46:57,400 --> 01:46:59,999
My bey, Osman Bey is
coming this way with his men.

1274
01:47:00,000 --> 01:47:02,279
Untie the monk.

1275
01:47:12,800 --> 01:47:15,039
Alps, retreat to the forest.

1276
01:47:15,040 --> 01:47:15,839
Better run!

1277
01:47:15,840 --> 01:47:16,559
Run.

1278
01:47:16,560 --> 01:47:18,999
You can only run away.

1279
01:47:22,200 --> 01:47:23,559
My bey, the monk.

1280
01:47:23,920 --> 01:47:25,269
Untie the monk.

1281
01:47:34,800 --> 01:47:36,839
Look at what they did to make him speak.

1282
01:47:36,840 --> 01:47:39,359
But he didn't talk.

1283
01:47:58,560 --> 01:48:01,239
We don't disrespect others'...

1284
01:48:01,440 --> 01:48:05,119
...sacred things while
looking for our own.

1285
01:48:15,960 --> 01:48:18,159
Tell me now.

1286
01:48:18,680 --> 01:48:21,759
The sacred relics of
Islam have been stolen.

1287
01:48:22,080 --> 01:48:24,159
Who did it?

1288
01:48:25,880 --> 01:48:28,839
Tell me, who are you working with?

1289
01:48:29,040 --> 01:48:31,759
Who are you working with?

1290
01:48:32,800 --> 01:48:33,919
The mona...

1291
01:48:37,560 --> 01:48:38,759
The mo...

1292
01:48:40,480 --> 01:48:42,919
They hid it in the monastery...

1293
01:48:46,880 --> 01:48:48,879
Let's go and get it my bey.

1294
01:48:49,040 --> 01:48:51,839
Brother they must have
taken so many precautions.

1295
01:48:52,360 --> 01:48:57,559
No, once the wolves
appear the jackals just run.

1296
01:48:57,720 --> 01:48:59,319
But...

1297
01:48:59,320 --> 01:49:03,599
...I'll walk to death if I
need to take the relics.

1298
01:49:05,440 --> 01:49:08,119
I will never let the infidels have it.

1299
01:49:11,880 --> 01:49:14,759
The traitors are taking
a stroll in the tribe.

1300
01:49:14,760 --> 01:49:17,599
They served poison at the bey's table.

1301
01:49:17,600 --> 01:49:20,039
They murdered Osman Bey's...

1302
01:49:20,040 --> 01:49:23,199
...unborn grandkid.

1303
01:49:23,440 --> 01:49:25,159
But those who were standing guard...

1304
01:49:25,160 --> 01:49:31,079
...the ones I trust with my life and
my country are sleeping standing huh?

1305
01:49:31,080 --> 01:49:32,359
Is that so?

1306
01:49:32,360 --> 01:49:34,879
My Shahzade, the alps were on the look.

1307
01:49:34,880 --> 01:49:36,279
We didn't see anything that night;

1308
01:49:36,280 --> 01:49:38,279
You should have seen.

1309
01:49:38,280 --> 01:49:39,799
You should have heard.

1310
01:49:39,800 --> 01:49:41,639
You should have prevented!

1311
01:49:41,640 --> 01:49:43,839
What does standing guard mean?

1312
01:49:44,680 --> 01:49:47,439
Standing guard is your honor.

1313
01:49:48,280 --> 01:49:52,359
Those who don't take care of their
honor have no place in front of me.

1314
01:49:52,360 --> 01:49:55,559
Get out of my sight.

1315
01:49:56,800 --> 01:49:58,279
My bey.

1316
01:50:01,320 --> 01:50:02,799
Tell me.

1317
01:50:17,800 --> 01:50:19,679
Prepare my horse.

1318
01:50:19,680 --> 01:50:21,359
As you wish my bey.

1319
01:50:30,960 --> 01:50:32,759
Bayhan.

1320
01:50:32,760 --> 01:50:34,759
My brave husband.

1321
01:50:35,040 --> 01:50:37,679
Do something and get me out of here.

1322
01:50:37,680 --> 01:50:40,559
What are you saying
wife? How could I do that?

1323
01:50:40,560 --> 01:50:42,799
There's no other way.

1324
01:50:43,600 --> 01:50:47,279
That Black Widow must've played this game.

1325
01:50:47,560 --> 01:50:50,199
Osman Bey's grandchild died.

1326
01:50:50,200 --> 01:50:52,199
They'll kill my mother, father.

1327
01:50:53,920 --> 01:50:58,999
I am going to die so young
because of that black widow!

1328
01:50:59,320 --> 01:51:02,039
You don't know what you are talking about.

1329
01:51:02,160 --> 01:51:05,479
If you escape now, it will be like
accepting that you committed the crime.

1330
01:51:05,480 --> 01:51:07,359
Then we will lose our reputation!

1331
01:51:07,360 --> 01:51:10,239
I am worried about my life here!

1332
01:51:10,240 --> 01:51:13,559
Okay, my hatun. Calm down.

1333
01:51:13,560 --> 01:51:17,359
Look, I will do everything I
can to prove your innocence.

1334
01:51:17,680 --> 01:51:20,559
Okay? Wait here.

1335
01:51:30,560 --> 01:51:32,159
Saruca.

1336
01:51:33,760 --> 01:51:34,959
My son.

1337
01:51:35,480 --> 01:51:37,879
You won't leave me here, right?

1338
01:51:40,560 --> 01:51:42,279
I won't, mother.

1339
01:51:43,880 --> 01:51:46,359
I will find a way to save you.

1340
01:51:47,760 --> 01:51:49,639
I will..

1341
01:51:51,320 --> 01:51:53,999
...but it will be hard to prove your
innocence if it's Begum's scheme.

1342
01:51:54,080 --> 01:51:56,559
Oh no!
-Mother...

1343
01:52:01,080 --> 01:52:03,319
Wait for me.

1344
01:52:04,520 --> 01:52:06,199
My brave son!

1345
01:52:10,640 --> 01:52:12,959
Oh Allah.

1346
01:52:12,960 --> 01:52:14,999
Oh Allah, I swear...

1347
01:52:15,000 --> 01:52:17,959
...if I can get rid of this slander...

1348
01:52:18,200 --> 01:52:20,959
...I will slaughter 10 goats.

1349
01:52:22,600 --> 01:52:26,959
No, I will slaughter 20 goats!
I won't leave any hungry people around!

1350
01:52:26,960 --> 01:52:33,839
Oh Allah, save me.

1351
01:52:49,440 --> 01:52:52,959
Magnus take the relics
and bring them to Karesi.

1352
01:52:53,840 --> 01:52:55,359
As you command.

1353
01:52:56,600 --> 01:53:00,359
Karesi Bey will earn great fame with this.

1354
01:53:01,040 --> 01:53:03,319
Let him think that.

1355
01:53:03,800 --> 01:53:06,799
At the end of the day, he and
Osman will fight each other.

1356
01:53:07,080 --> 01:53:09,159
While they fight...

1357
01:53:09,480 --> 01:53:12,639
...we will revive Holy Roman Empire.

1358
01:53:17,160 --> 01:53:20,199
Hasten to the prayer!

1359
01:53:20,680 --> 01:53:23,519
Hasten to the prayer!

1360
01:53:24,680 --> 01:53:27,719
Hasten to happiness.

1361
01:53:28,360 --> 01:53:31,319
Hasten to happiness.

1362
01:53:32,400 --> 01:53:35,159
The prayer has begun.

1363
01:53:37,560 --> 01:53:40,559
The prayer has begun.

1364
01:53:41,480 --> 01:53:45,559
Allah is the Greatest!

1365
01:53:46,000 --> 01:53:50,119
There is none worthy
of worship except Allah.

1366
01:54:02,280 --> 01:54:04,799
Oh my daisy.

1367
01:54:17,640 --> 01:54:21,119
Your name is Hayme.

1368
01:54:26,160 --> 01:54:29,279
Your name is Hayme.

1369
01:54:31,880 --> 01:54:33,879
Your name is...

1370
01:54:34,800 --> 01:54:36,319
...Hayme.

1371
01:54:46,720 --> 01:54:48,719
Alaeddin.

1372
01:55:09,400 --> 01:55:12,719
My child!

1373
01:55:19,520 --> 01:55:22,999
My child!

1374
01:55:26,720 --> 01:55:29,999
My daughter!

1375
01:55:40,200 --> 01:55:42,759
My daisy...

1376
01:55:45,680 --> 01:55:48,959
Oh my child!

1377
01:55:50,960 --> 01:55:55,479
Oh Allah!

1378
01:55:58,920 --> 01:55:59,799
Come on dear.

1379
01:56:01,400 --> 01:56:03,439
No.

1380
01:56:08,480 --> 01:56:09,759
Come on.

1381
01:56:09,800 --> 01:56:10,999
No.

1382
01:56:11,680 --> 01:56:14,199
Alaeddin I won't give her.

1383
01:56:15,200 --> 01:56:18,119
Don't take her Alaeddin.

1384
01:56:18,800 --> 01:56:20,599
Alaeddin.

1385
01:56:23,320 --> 01:56:26,119
My baby.

1386
01:56:26,640 --> 01:56:29,759
Don't take our baby.

1387
01:56:30,080 --> 01:56:32,319
She'll always be with you.

1388
01:56:32,480 --> 01:56:35,839
Come on.

1389
01:56:35,880 --> 01:56:36,759
Hey.

1390
01:56:39,240 --> 01:56:42,159
You can't put her here.

1391
01:56:42,720 --> 01:56:44,359
No.

1392
01:56:44,960 --> 01:56:47,119
My girl. My girl.

1393
01:56:47,120 --> 01:56:50,119
Please for the love
of Allah. Please don't.

1394
01:56:50,160 --> 01:56:53,119
Please for the love of Allah don't.

1395
01:56:53,840 --> 01:56:58,119
How can you?
She is my little daughter.

1396
01:56:59,640 --> 01:57:02,099
Allah.

1397
01:57:06,080 --> 01:57:08,479
In the name of Allah.

1398
01:57:09,720 --> 01:57:10,999
My baby.

1399
01:57:12,120 --> 01:57:14,199
It's a tough test.

1400
01:57:14,880 --> 01:57:16,119
May Allah give you power.

1401
01:57:16,480 --> 01:57:21,079
My baby's in the grave now.

1402
01:57:22,200 --> 01:57:24,919
My girl's gone!

1403
01:57:33,360 --> 01:57:34,759
It'll pass Gonca.

1404
01:57:36,240 --> 01:57:37,879
It'll pass.

1405
01:57:40,760 --> 01:57:43,159
My baby.

1406
01:57:43,160 --> 01:57:47,639
Alaeddin what are you doing?

1407
01:57:48,320 --> 01:57:50,879
How did you handle it mother?

1408
01:57:50,880 --> 01:57:53,079
How am I going to hold on?

1409
01:57:53,520 --> 01:57:56,719
Tell me. How can I hold on?

1410
01:57:57,880 --> 01:58:00,759
What will I do mother?

1411
01:58:04,080 --> 01:58:05,399
It'll pass my girl.

1412
01:58:05,400 --> 01:58:06,479
It'll pass.

1413
01:58:11,400 --> 01:58:13,519
It's hard.

1414
01:58:14,120 --> 01:58:15,559
But It'll pass.

1415
01:58:18,480 --> 01:58:23,159
My baby.

1416
01:58:26,280 --> 01:58:29,799
What will I do?

1417
01:58:29,920 --> 01:58:31,399
Allah gave her to us.

1418
01:58:33,680 --> 01:58:34,799
And Allah took her.

1419
01:58:38,200 --> 01:58:39,879
Holofira sent word my Bey.

1420
01:58:40,160 --> 01:58:43,439
Magnus left with his soldiers.

1421
01:58:43,520 --> 01:58:45,599
They'll make an important delivery.

1422
01:58:45,680 --> 01:58:47,759
But Holofira doesn't know what.

1423
01:58:49,800 --> 01:58:50,879
Magnus.

1424
01:58:51,560 --> 01:58:53,319
He'll go to the monastery.

1425
01:58:53,320 --> 01:58:55,319
To take the relics.

1426
01:58:57,360 --> 01:58:58,999
We'll go there too.

1427
01:58:59,000 --> 01:59:00,839
Come on. Sent word to Gencer Bey.

1428
01:59:00,840 --> 01:59:02,479
He must support us.

1429
01:59:02,480 --> 01:59:03,679
As you wish my Bey.

1430
01:59:04,000 --> 01:59:04,919
Come on.

1431
01:59:11,080 --> 01:59:14,039
We'll Karesi Bey his relics.

1432
01:59:14,080 --> 01:59:15,159
Hurry! Now!

1433
01:59:47,680 --> 01:59:49,239
Allah.

1434
01:59:50,320 --> 01:59:52,199
Allah.

1435
01:59:55,160 --> 01:59:57,279
Sisters!

1436
01:59:57,280 --> 01:59:59,239
Allah.

1437
01:59:59,240 --> 02:00:00,679
Oh no!

1438
02:00:00,680 --> 02:00:02,679
Sisters come quick.

1439
02:00:03,600 --> 02:00:05,639
Take me to a healer.

1440
02:00:05,640 --> 02:00:06,599
I'm dying.

1441
02:00:06,640 --> 02:00:08,599
Let's take her to the healer.

1442
02:00:09,800 --> 02:00:11,519
It's your turn Sarucam.

1443
02:00:16,920 --> 02:00:18,679
I'm cold.

1444
02:00:24,360 --> 02:00:27,559
I'm shaking.

1445
02:00:30,280 --> 02:00:31,599
Let's go now.

1446
02:00:32,920 --> 02:00:35,639
Was there anyone but you while cooking?

1447
02:00:37,120 --> 02:00:38,999
Think about it carefully.

1448
02:00:40,560 --> 02:00:42,719
No. I swear.

1449
02:00:43,120 --> 02:00:44,359
Think again.

1450
02:00:44,720 --> 02:00:47,879
Was anyone from Bayhan
Bey's family around?

1451
02:00:49,560 --> 02:00:51,519
It was crowded outside Begum Hatun.

1452
02:00:51,920 --> 02:00:52,759
So there was.

1453
02:00:54,600 --> 02:00:57,799
Who told you to investigate Hatun?

1454
02:01:02,160 --> 02:01:04,599
Is this your place to do this?

1455
02:01:04,600 --> 02:01:09,039
What are you doing here
instead of going to Karadin Castle?

1456
02:01:09,280 --> 02:01:11,956
I'm working hard so that
the one who killed your...

1457
02:01:11,968 --> 02:01:15,039
...grandkid and tried to kill me
gets punished, Bala Hatun.

1458
02:01:15,040 --> 02:01:16,239
No.

1459
02:01:16,240 --> 02:01:18,599
I know what you're trying to do.

1460
02:01:18,720 --> 02:01:23,519
You want to punish Hazal
Hatun, not the murderer.

1461
02:01:23,760 --> 02:01:27,079
But what you're doing
is stepping over the line.

1462
02:01:27,080 --> 02:01:28,759
Now.

1463
02:01:28,760 --> 02:01:30,919
Go to your position.

1464
02:01:31,080 --> 02:01:32,799
From now on..

1465
02:01:32,800 --> 02:01:37,079
...don't try to do something
that wasn't given to you as a duty.

1466
02:01:37,320 --> 02:01:38,879
Come on.

1467
02:01:51,640 --> 02:01:53,719
Everyone, back to work.

1468
02:01:59,800 --> 02:02:02,519
Commander Lucas...

1469
02:02:02,920 --> 02:02:06,279
...gave me such a gift...

1470
02:02:06,280 --> 02:02:09,599
...that I can say that it's
even worth this nation.

1471
02:02:10,200 --> 02:02:13,479
All of the Islam world will talk
about the Karesi Beyhood, my bey.

1472
02:02:13,480 --> 02:02:16,839
And when Osman Bey hears
that you found the relics...

1473
02:02:16,840 --> 02:02:19,519
...he will get so jealous.

1474
02:02:20,000 --> 02:02:22,439
Just you wait.

1475
02:02:22,760 --> 02:02:25,959
I'm going to do so much worse to him.

1476
02:02:27,080 --> 02:02:30,079
Osman say my nation...

1477
02:02:30,080 --> 02:02:32,479
...this and that all the time.

1478
02:02:32,760 --> 02:02:37,559
I'm going to show him
who has the real nation.

1479
02:02:39,240 --> 02:02:43,559
This name will bring the
beys to your side, my bey.

1480
02:02:43,920 --> 02:02:46,959
Firstly, Begum Hatun.

1481
02:02:47,280 --> 02:02:49,039
Then...

1482
02:02:49,400 --> 02:02:54,039
...the other beys will come to
me and swore their loyalty to me.

1483
02:02:54,040 --> 02:02:56,399
All of them.

1484
02:02:57,080 --> 02:02:58,319
Karesi Bey.

1485
02:02:58,320 --> 02:03:00,639
Hadrath Vizier.

1486
02:03:00,640 --> 02:03:03,119
I have good news.

1487
02:03:03,960 --> 02:03:07,399
Today is

1488
02:03:08,000 --> 02:03:10,239
The relics...

1489
02:03:12,840 --> 02:03:15,199
Did you find them?

1490
02:03:15,360 --> 02:03:18,239
It was a bit hard but...

1491
02:03:18,920 --> 02:03:20,919
...we did find them Vizier Hadrath.

1492
02:03:20,920 --> 02:03:23,079
Thank Allah.

1493
02:03:23,160 --> 02:03:26,439
You trusted the best
man there is for the job.

1494
02:03:26,440 --> 02:03:28,199
And Karesi..

1495
02:03:28,200 --> 02:03:31,599
...didn't let you down,
would he ever do that?

1496
02:03:31,760 --> 02:03:34,599
Thank you Karesi Bey.

1497
02:03:34,880 --> 02:03:37,159
The Caliph Hadrath...

1498
02:03:37,360 --> 02:03:41,199
...will reward you for your hard work.

1499
02:03:41,640 --> 02:03:44,039
Your name will be the
first to be mentioned...

1500
02:03:44,040 --> 02:03:48,079
...in the Islam world.

1501
02:03:50,440 --> 02:03:53,239
That's not important at all.

1502
02:03:53,840 --> 02:03:55,559
What's important is...

1503
02:03:55,560 --> 02:03:59,839
...the honor of the Islam world.

1504
02:04:01,520 --> 02:04:04,079
Thank you Karesi Bey.

1505
02:04:04,680 --> 02:04:06,399
Thank you.

1506
02:04:09,240 --> 02:04:11,439
Let me go.

1507
02:04:12,920 --> 02:04:14,919
What does this mean commander?

1508
02:04:14,920 --> 02:04:16,519
Let me go this instance.

1509
02:04:16,520 --> 02:04:19,719
If you have doves that spy...

1510
02:04:19,720 --> 02:04:22,239
...then I have birds in this castle.

1511
02:04:27,200 --> 02:04:29,479
Did you think I wouldn't figure it out?

1512
02:04:33,080 --> 02:04:35,439
Are you going to kill me?

1513
02:04:39,960 --> 02:04:41,959
No.

1514
02:04:41,960 --> 02:04:46,639
I won't kill you for trying to
making a fool of me with...

1515
02:04:46,640 --> 02:04:49,359
...with your tiny brain.

1516
02:04:51,520 --> 02:04:53,639
Soldiers.

1517
02:04:56,320 --> 02:04:59,079
Treat our captive well.

1518
02:05:01,320 --> 02:05:03,519
She's going to be a bride soon.

1519
02:05:05,680 --> 02:05:08,359
What are you saying? I don't understand.

1520
02:05:10,200 --> 02:05:15,359
You're going to marry a Byzantine
commander without wasting time.

1521
02:05:21,800 --> 02:05:22,919
Monestry

1522
02:05:25,160 --> 02:05:29,119
Keep your eyes peeled, we're
going to take the relics and leave.

1523
02:05:41,680 --> 02:05:43,359
Surround the monastery.

1524
02:05:43,360 --> 02:05:45,559
He won't make it out of here.

1525
02:06:53,280 --> 02:06:54,799
Magnus

1526
02:06:56,200 --> 02:06:58,199
Kill him!

1527
02:07:05,000 --> 02:07:10,479
We will cut the hands
that touch our sacred relics!

1528
02:07:26,080 --> 02:07:30,119
Magnus or whoever you are!
Where are you running to!?

1529
02:07:43,080 --> 02:07:44,719
Magnus!

1530
02:07:45,120 --> 02:07:47,519
You are lucky you are carrying the relics!

1531
02:07:54,720 --> 02:07:57,199
You can never get the relics back!

1532
02:08:35,360 --> 02:08:37,319
Iltutan!

1533
02:08:47,280 --> 02:08:48,919
Oh no.

1534
02:08:49,080 --> 02:08:52,679
Saruca

1535
02:08:52,880 --> 02:08:55,999
Saruca!

1536
02:08:56,240 --> 02:08:58,759
Allah! They are coming!

1537
02:08:58,760 --> 02:09:00,439
I can see!

1538
02:09:01,400 --> 02:09:04,119
Demons are coming to take me!

1539
02:09:04,200 --> 02:09:06,239
Allah!

1540
02:09:06,240 --> 02:09:08,559
You are feeling a bit nervous.

1541
02:09:08,560 --> 02:09:11,639
Calm down first. I will
give you some medicine.

1542
02:09:11,640 --> 02:09:15,319
It will make you sleep nicely.

1543
02:09:16,000 --> 02:09:17,639
Make me sleep?

1544
02:09:18,200 --> 02:09:20,359
You will sleep so tight.

1545
02:09:20,640 --> 02:09:21,679
Allah!

1546
02:09:24,040 --> 02:09:27,119
Saruca! Allah!

1547
02:09:28,480 --> 02:09:32,719
Allah!
Allah!

1548
02:09:34,040 --> 02:09:36,999
Saruca!

1549
02:09:37,280 --> 02:09:39,799
You will forget everything.

1550
02:09:41,480 --> 02:09:45,359
Hazal Hatun, come on,
open your mouth. Drink this.

1551
02:09:46,280 --> 02:09:48,119
Saruca!

1552
02:09:48,120 --> 02:09:50,279
Open your mouth.

1553
02:09:51,160 --> 02:09:52,039
Open it.

1554
02:09:52,240 --> 02:09:53,599
Help me!

1555
02:09:54,560 --> 02:09:57,599
Sister! Healer!

1556
02:09:57,680 --> 02:09:59,719
Go on, healer.

1557
02:09:59,720 --> 02:10:02,279
-They're calling you!
-I'll be back.

1558
02:10:07,120 --> 02:10:08,559
Are you okay?

1559
02:10:08,560 --> 02:10:10,719
I am coming.
-Help me!

1560
02:10:10,720 --> 02:10:13,999
Help me! Healer! I am dying!

1561
02:10:14,000 --> 02:10:15,879
Finally!

1562
02:10:18,280 --> 02:10:19,269
Mother.

1563
02:10:19,269 --> 02:10:21,279
Where have you been!?
Saruca!

1564
02:10:22,880 --> 02:10:23,799
Mother.

1565
02:10:23,840 --> 02:10:24,919
Saruca.

1566
02:10:24,960 --> 02:10:27,279
Mother. Come on.

1567
02:10:28,160 --> 02:10:30,519
Come on.

1568
02:10:32,960 --> 02:10:34,999
Take this.

1569
02:10:36,440 --> 02:10:40,359
Mother, come on, hurry up.

1570
02:10:41,920 --> 02:10:43,679
Hold me!

1571
02:10:45,000 --> 02:10:48,319
Come here.

1572
02:10:53,160 --> 02:10:54,399
In the name of Allah.

1573
02:11:03,320 --> 02:11:03,919
Are you okay?

1574
02:11:03,920 --> 02:11:05,919
I'm okay.
-Okay.

1575
02:11:06,240 --> 02:11:07,919
Close your mouth.

1576
02:11:15,040 --> 02:11:16,719
In the name of Allah.

1577
02:11:31,160 --> 02:11:34,399
If Hazal Hatun gets charged...

1578
02:11:35,560 --> 02:11:38,839
...what can I do?
She'll pay for it.

1579
02:11:40,200 --> 02:11:43,399
Well... I'm a strong man.

1580
02:11:43,840 --> 02:11:46,239
A Bey needs a Hatun.

1581
02:11:47,320 --> 02:11:49,919
I can't mourn forever.

1582
02:11:51,880 --> 02:11:54,719
I'll look for a new Hatun.

1583
02:12:12,160 --> 02:12:13,119
Saruca.

1584
02:12:14,000 --> 02:12:15,359
Saruca.

1585
02:12:21,400 --> 02:12:22,679
You'll ruin my plans!

1586
02:12:40,000 --> 02:12:41,279
Mother.

1587
02:12:45,320 --> 02:12:47,039
Mother it's father.

1588
02:12:47,200 --> 02:12:49,199
We're doomed.

1589
02:12:58,440 --> 02:13:01,559
Bayhan Bey. You look great.

1590
02:13:01,560 --> 02:13:03,559
Why are you here?

1591
02:13:03,800 --> 02:13:06,759
Look. What are you doing here?

1592
02:13:06,760 --> 02:13:08,639
This must end now. Go back.

1593
02:13:08,880 --> 02:13:09,599
Come on.

1594
02:13:09,600 --> 02:13:11,599
No. I can't.

1595
02:13:11,760 --> 02:13:14,159
Saruca. Ride. Come on.

1596
02:13:17,640 --> 02:13:21,239
I told you to go back. I'll scream.

1597
02:13:22,040 --> 02:13:24,639
Father.
-Okay Bey.

1598
02:13:24,680 --> 02:13:26,639
Come on. Go back.

1599
02:13:29,840 --> 02:13:32,879
Karadin Castle.

1600
02:13:32,960 --> 02:13:35,959
Hurry. Kill the Kayi Alps.

1601
02:13:35,960 --> 02:13:37,959
Prepare the burning arrows.

1602
02:13:56,400 --> 02:14:00,759
This castle will be the
biggest trading spot.

1603
02:14:01,200 --> 02:14:04,359
There will be inns and traders.

1604
02:14:04,960 --> 02:14:07,999
Allah willing we'll have
more castles sister.

1605
02:14:13,400 --> 02:14:14,559
Alps.

1606
02:14:14,600 --> 02:14:15,719
Shut the gates.

1607
02:14:16,160 --> 02:14:17,879
Watchers on duty.

1608
02:14:17,920 --> 02:14:21,199
From now on, no one will
enter and leave the castle.

1609
02:14:21,200 --> 02:14:22,879
As you wish, Begum Hatun!

1610
02:14:38,160 --> 02:14:39,239
Here they are.

1611
02:14:39,240 --> 02:14:41,799
The castle will be torn
when Lucas sends word.

1612
02:14:42,160 --> 02:14:44,199
Get up Hatun. You embarrassed me.

1613
02:14:44,200 --> 02:14:46,199
Someone will see. get up.

1614
02:14:46,360 --> 02:14:48,199
Allah...
-Mother?

1615
02:14:48,600 --> 02:14:50,679
Is someone here?
-No.

1616
02:15:04,040 --> 02:15:06,759
Alps! Alps! She's getting away.

1617
02:15:06,760 --> 02:15:08,759
Wait. Wait.

1618
02:15:08,760 --> 02:15:10,759
Shut up! Shut up!

1619
02:15:11,200 --> 02:15:13,479
Shut up! I'm letting go.

1620
02:15:15,160 --> 02:15:17,119
Wait.Okay? Wait.

1621
02:15:18,000 --> 02:15:21,119
What are you saying? You're mistaken.

1622
02:15:21,120 --> 02:15:24,559
Hazal's taking a breath. She's going back.

1623
02:15:24,880 --> 02:15:25,999
Okay?

1624
02:15:26,000 --> 02:15:27,999
Don't scream okay?

1625
02:15:28,280 --> 02:15:31,039
Good boy. Hazal go inside.

1626
02:15:31,080 --> 02:15:32,359
You, get los. Okay?

1627
02:15:32,360 --> 02:15:34,359
I saw what I saw.

1628
02:15:35,120 --> 02:15:38,039
But I want something in return.

1629
02:15:39,120 --> 02:15:40,039
What?

1630
02:15:40,040 --> 02:15:42,039
Gold.
-No way.

1631
02:15:42,480 --> 02:15:43,519
What did you say?

1632
02:15:43,840 --> 02:15:45,039
Gold.

1633
02:15:45,080 --> 02:15:49,199
If you won't give it...Alps!

1634
02:15:50,280 --> 02:15:51,559
Shut up Gazi.

1635
02:15:51,680 --> 02:15:53,199
Okay wait.

1636
02:15:53,480 --> 02:15:55,239
Dad give it to him.

1637
02:16:00,560 --> 02:16:01,999
Here.

1638
02:16:02,360 --> 02:16:03,799
-Go now.
-Go, go now.

1639
